#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"A Control node for rendering Markdown text with scroll, text selection, search, and streaming "
"support."
msgstr "渲染 Markdown 文本的 Control 节点，支持滚动、选择、搜索和流式输出。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Activates the given link URI. A [code]#id[/code] link scrolls to the matching anchor before "
"emitting [signal link_pressed]. If [member open_external_links] is [code]true[/code] and the URI "
"starts with [code]http://[/code] or [code]https://[/code], opens it in the system default "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"激活指定的链接 URI。[code]#id[/code] 链接会先滚动到对应锚点，再发出 [signal link_pressed] 信号。当 "
"[member open_external_links] 为 [code]true[/code]，且 URI 以 [code]http://[/code] 或 "
"[code]https://[/code] 开头时，使用系统默认浏览器打开。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Additional font size added to all text sizes in the document. Clamped to [code][0, 16][/code]. "
"Can also be changed by the user with Ctrl+MouseWheel."
msgstr "应用于文档所有文本的额外字号。取值限制在 [code][0, 16][/code]。用户也可用 Ctrl+鼠标滚轮调整。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Aligns the formula horizontally. Left and right mirror in right-to-left layouts. Fill places the "
"formula at the left without stretching it."
msgstr "设置公式的水平对齐方式。在从右向左的布局中，左对齐和右对齐互换。填充模式会将公式放在左侧，保持原尺寸。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Aligns the formula vertically inside the normal stylebox margins. Fill places the formula at the "
"top."
msgstr "在常规样式盒的边距内垂直对齐公式。填充模式会将公式放在顶部。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Allows 3D lights to affect the formula."
msgstr "使公式受 3D 光照影响。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Appends [param delta] to the current Markdown text. When [member streaming_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code], only the unstable tail region is re-parsed for performance. When [member "
"scroll_following] is [code]true[/code] and the scroll bar was already at the bottom, the view "
"automatically scrolls to stay at the bottom."
msgstr ""
"将 [param delta] 追加到当前 Markdown 文本。[member streaming_enabled] 为 [code]true[/code] "
"时，仅重新解析尚未稳定的末尾区域以提升性能。[member scroll_following] 为 [code]true[/code] 且滚动条已在底部时，视图会跟随新内容保持在底部。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Autowrap space trimming flags. See [constant TextServer.BREAK_TRIM_START_EDGE_SPACES] and "
"[constant TextServer.BREAK_TRIM_END_EDGE_SPACES]."
msgstr ""
"自动换行时的空格裁剪标志。参见 [constant TextServer.BREAK_TRIM_START_EDGE_SPACES] 和 [constant "
"TextServer.BREAK_TRIM_END_EDGE_SPACES]。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
msgid "Background drawn when the control has keyboard focus."
msgstr "控件拥有键盘焦点时绘制的背景。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Blends transparent texels."
msgstr "对透明纹素进行混合。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid ""
"Call [method parse] on the main thread to create a layout. Keep the [TeXRender] instance to "
"measure it and draw it repeatedly. Call [method draw] from [method CanvasItem._draw] or a [signal"
" CanvasItem.draw] callback.\n"
"Use [constant STYLE_TEXT] for inline math. Use [method get_baseline_offset] to align the formula "
"with the baseline of surrounding text."
msgstr ""
"在主线程调用 [method parse] 创建布局。保留 [TeXRender] 实例以反复测量和绘制。请从 [method CanvasItem._draw] 或 [signal "
"CanvasItem.draw] 的回调中调用 [method draw]。\n"
"行内公式使用 [constant STYLE_TEXT]。使用 [method get_baseline_offset] 将公式基线与周围文字对齐。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid ""
"Changes the foreground of the current layout. A fully transparent color uses MicroTeX's default "
"foreground. Colors specified in the expression still apply."
msgstr "更改当前布局的前景色。使用完全透明的颜色时，沿用 MicroTeX 的默认前景色。表达式内部指定的颜色仍然生效。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Clears all Markdown text and resets the document state. Emits [signal text_changed]."
msgstr "清空 Markdown 文本并重置文档状态。发出 [signal text_changed]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Clears the current text selection."
msgstr "清除当前的文本选择。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Clears the layout, its settings, and the last error."
msgstr "清除布局、布局设置和上次错误。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid "Clears the output, metadata, and error."
msgstr "清除输出、元数据和错误。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Clips formula drawing to the control's rectangle. The formula can be laid out in a narrower "
"control when enabled. Its height and the normal stylebox margins still contribute to the minimum "
"size."
msgstr "将公式裁剪到控件矩形内。启用后可在更窄的控件内排版，高度和常规样式盒的边距仍计入最小尺寸。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid "Color of connections and arrowheads for diagram types that support a shared line color."
msgstr "连线和箭头的颜色，适用于支持统一连线颜色的图表类型。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid "Color of node text and labels that use the diagram's shared text color."
msgstr "图表节点文字以及使用图表统一文字颜色的标签颜色。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Context menu item ID for the Copy action."
msgstr "右键菜单中「复制」的菜单项 ID。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Context menu item ID for the Select All action."
msgstr "右键菜单中「全选」的菜单项 ID。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Controls [member double_sided]."
msgstr "控制 [member double_sided]。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Controls [member fixed_size]."
msgstr "控制 [member fixed_size]。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Controls [member no_depth_test]."
msgstr "控制 [member no_depth_test]。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Controls [member shaded]."
msgstr "控制 [member shaded]。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Controls how the formula faces the camera."
msgstr "控制公式如何朝向摄像机。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Controls how the material handles transparent texels."
msgstr "控制材质如何处理透明纹素。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid "Controls palette selection in [constant THEME_AUTO]. Falls back to the [Label] theme's font color."
msgstr "控制 [constant THEME_AUTO] 的配色选择。未设置时使用 [Label] 主题的字体颜色。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Cramped display math style."
msgstr "紧缩独立公式样式。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Cramped inline math style."
msgstr "紧缩行内公式样式。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Cramped nested script math style."
msgstr "紧缩嵌套上下标样式。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Cramped script math style."
msgstr "紧缩上下标样式。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid ""
"Create a [MermaidRender] instance to configure a diagram, export it, or read its layout for "
"custom drawing. Call [method render] on the main thread. The operation is synchronous and stores "
"its result on the instance.\n"
"Use [method get_texture] for PNG or JPEG output, [method get_output_text] for SVG, ASCII, or "
"JSON, and [method get_bytes] for binary data. The current SDK backend is available in Windows x64"
" MSVC builds with Merman enabled."
msgstr ""
"创建 [MermaidRender] 实例来配置或导出图表，也可以读取布局用于自定义绘制。在主线程调用 [method render]。操作同步执行，结果保存在实例上。\n"
"使用 [method get_texture] 读取 PNG 或 JPEG 输出，使用 [method get_output_text] 读取 SVG、ASCII 或 JSON，使用 "
"[method get_bytes] 读取二进制数据。启用 Merman 的 Windows x64 MSVC 构建支持当前 SDK 后端。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [ImageTexture] from the current PNG or JPEG output. Keep the returned texture if "
"you plan to draw it repeatedly."
msgstr "根据当前 PNG 或 JPEG 输出创建新的 [ImageTexture]。如果需要反复绘制，请保留返回的纹理。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid ""
"Decodes the current PNG or JPEG output into a new [Image]. Returns [code]null[/code] for other "
"output formats or an empty result."
msgstr "将当前的 PNG 或 JPEG 输出解码为新的 [Image]。输出为空或使用其他格式时返回 [code]null[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
msgid "Default background and content margins for the formula."
msgstr "公式的默认背景和内容边距。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Deferred streaming layout flush interval in milliseconds. Clamped to [code][1, 1000][/code]."
msgstr "延迟流式排版的刷新间隔，单位为毫秒。取值限制在 [code][1, 1000][/code]。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Disables the depth test for the formula material."
msgstr "禁用公式材质的深度测试。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Discards texels below the opacity threshold."
msgstr "丢弃不透明度低于阈值的纹素。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Display math style."
msgstr "独立公式样式。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Displays a LaTeX formula in a 3D scene."
msgstr "在 3D 场景中显示 LaTeX 公式。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
msgid "Displays a LaTeX math expression using MicroTeX."
msgstr "使用 MicroTeX 显示 LaTeX 数学表达式。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid "Displays a standalone Mermaid diagram using Merman."
msgstr "使用 Merman 显示独立的 Mermaid 图表。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Draws both sides of the formula quad."
msgstr "绘制公式四边形的两面。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Draws opaque portions in a depth prepass."
msgstr "在深度预通道中绘制不透明区域。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid ""
"Draws the current layout with its top-left corner at [param position] in [param canvas]'s local "
"coordinates. After drawing, the canvas item's draw transform is set to identity."
msgstr "绘制当前布局，使其左上角位于 [param canvas] 局部坐标中的 [param position]。绘制完成后，画布项的绘制变换会恢复为单位变换。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Emitted when [member extra_font_size] changes, either programmatically or via Ctrl+MouseWheel."
msgstr "[member extra_font_size] 通过代码或 Ctrl+鼠标滚轮发生变化时发出。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a link is clicked. [param uri] is the target URL. If [member open_external_links] is"
" [code]true[/code], http/https links are also opened in the browser automatically."
msgstr ""
"点击链接时发出。[param uri] 是目标 URL。[member open_external_links] 为 [code]true[/code] 时，还会在浏览器中自动打开 "
"http/https 链接。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the Markdown parser encounters a warning, such as a broken image or an unrecognized "
"block type."
msgstr "Markdown 解析器遇到警告时发出，例如图片无法加载或遇到无法识别的块类型。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the Markdown text changes via [method set_markdown_text], [method append_text], "
"[method clear], or [method load_markdown_file]."
msgstr ""
"通过 [method set_markdown_text]、[method append_text]、[method clear] 或 [method load_markdown_file] "
"修改 Markdown 文本时发出。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the current diagram finishes rendering. Inspect [method get_texture] and [method "
"get_render_error] for the result."
msgstr "当前图表完成渲染时发出。通过 [method get_texture] 和 [method get_render_error] 查看结果。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Enables or disables the specified draw flag."
msgstr "启用或禁用指定的绘制标志。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Enables the supported GitHub Flavored Markdown extensions for tables, task lists, strikethrough, "
"and [code]<www.example.com>[/code] autolinks. Changing this property reparses the current text. "
"Math parsing is controlled by [member parse_latex]."
msgstr ""
"启用表格、任务列表、删除线和 [code]<www.example.com>[/code] 自动链接等受支持的 GitHub Flavored Markdown "
"扩展。修改此属性会重新解析当前文本。数学公式解析由 [member parse_latex] 控制。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Enter Mermaid source directly in [member text]. The diagram renders in the background after the "
"control enters the scene tree. When ready, the diagram is centered in the control and its logical"
" size becomes the control's minimum size.\n"
"Use [member theme_mode] to select a default diagram palette. Set the [theme_item "
"node_background_color], [theme_item node_border_color], [theme_item node_text_color], and "
"[theme_item line_color] theme items to customize the diagram. Changing the theme rerenders the "
"diagram.\n"
"[method get_texture] returns the rendered texture for use by other controls. The Merman backend "
"is available in Windows x64 MSVC builds with the SDK installed."
msgstr ""
"在 [member text] 中直接输入 Mermaid 源码。控件进入场景树后，图表会在后台渲染。渲染完成后，图表在控件中居中，其逻辑尺寸成为控件的最小尺寸。\n"
"使用 [member theme_mode] 选择图表的默认配色。设置 [theme_item node_background_color]、[theme_item "
"node_border_color]、[theme_item node_text_color] 和 [theme_item line_color] 主题项可自定义图表。修改主题后会重新渲染图表。"
"\n"
"[method get_texture] 返回渲染后的纹理，供其他控件使用。安装 SDK 后，Windows x64 MSVC 构建可使用 Merman 后端。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Enter an expression such as [code]\\"
"frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}[/code] in [member text]. [LatexLabel] uses"
" embedded math fonts and draws the result on the Godot canvas. Its minimum size follows the "
"dimensions of the formula.\n"
"Use [member label_settings] to share a font size and color between labels, or override the "
"[code]font_size[/code] and [code]font_color[/code] theme items. Theme values fall back to the "
"[Label] theme."
msgstr ""
"在 [member text] 中输入表达式，例如 [code]\\"
"frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}[/code]。[LatexLabel] 使用内置数学字体在 Godot "
"画布上绘制公式，最小尺寸由公式大小决定。\n"
"使用 [member label_settings] 在多个标签间共享字号和颜色，也可以覆盖 [code]font_size[/code] 和 [code]font_color[/code] "
"主题项。未设置的主题值沿用 [Label] 的主题。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid ""
"Executes a Merman operation and replaces the previous result. Example IDs include "
"[code]png[/code], [code]svg[/code], [code]pdf[/code], [code]semantic-json[/code], [code]layout-"
"json[/code], and [code]validation-json[/code]. Consult [method get_runtime_catalog] for the full "
"list.\n"
"Pass Merman options as a dictionary with JSON-compatible values. Use [code]site_config[/code] for"
" Mermaid settings, [code]raster[/code] for image export settings, and [code]presentation[/code] "
"for Merman theme roles. Options depend on the operation. For document analysis, supply the "
"document text and its [param uri].\n"
"[param timeout_msec] limits the operation in milliseconds. Use [code]0[/code] to run without a "
"deadline. Returns [constant OK] when the operation produces a result. For validation and analysis"
" operations, inspect the returned JSON for diagnostics."
msgstr ""
"执行 Merman 操作并替换上一次的结果。操作 ID 示例包括 [code]png[/code]、[code]svg[/code]、[code]pdf[/code]、[code"
"]semantic-json[/code]、[code]layout-json[/code] 和 [code]validation-json[/code]。完整列表见 [method "
"get_runtime_catalog]。\n"
"通过字典传入 Merman 选项，字典值须兼容 JSON。Mermaid 设置用 [code]site_config[/code]，图片导出设置用 "
"[code]raster[/code]，Merman 主题角色设置用 [code]presentation[/code]。可用选项取决于操作。分析文档时请提供文档文本及其 [param "
"uri]。\n"
"[param timeout_msec] 指定操作时限，单位为毫秒。设为 [code]0[/code] 可取消时限。操作产生结果时返回 [constant "
"OK]。对于验证和分析操作，请检查返回的 JSON 中的诊断信息。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid ""
"Expands the layout to at least [param height] pixels, positioning the formula at the top, center,"
" or bottom of the extra space."
msgstr "将布局高度扩展到至少 [param height] 像素，使公式在额外空间中顶部对齐、居中或底部对齐。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid ""
"Expands the layout to at least [param width] pixels, positioning the formula at the left, center,"
" or right of the extra space."
msgstr "将布局宽度扩展到至少 [param width] 像素，使公式在额外空间中左对齐、居中或右对齐。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Exposes RichTextLabel-compatible visible-character scroll following. MarkdownLabel does not "
"currently implement visible-character clipping, so this property is stored but has no visual "
"effect."
msgstr "提供与 RichTextLabel 兼容的逐字显示滚动跟随属性。MarkdownLabel 目前尚未实现按可见字符数裁剪，因此该属性会保存但没有可见效果。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid "Fill color of diagram nodes, such as flowchart boxes and sequence diagram participants."
msgstr "图表节点的填充颜色，例如流程图方框和时序图参与者的背景。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Flushes any deferred streaming parse and layout update immediately. Returns [code]true[/code] if "
"pending text was flushed."
msgstr "立即执行延迟的流式解析和排版更新。处理了待更新的文本时返回 [code]true[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Font size used for formula layout, in pixels."
msgstr "公式排版使用的字号，单位为像素。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Forces a full re-parse of the entire document. Call this after the last [method append_text] call"
" to ensure correct final layout. Respects [member scroll_following] behavior."
msgstr "强制重新解析整篇文档。在最后一次调用 [method append_text] 后调用此方法，以生成正确的最终布局。遵循 [member scroll_following] 的设置。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
msgid "Foreground color for the formula when [member label_settings] is unset."
msgstr "未设置 [member label_settings] 时使用的公式前景色。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
msgid "Formula size when [member label_settings] is unset."
msgstr "未设置 [member label_settings] 时使用的公式字号。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Handles a menu option selection by its identifier. Typically used with the IDs from the [enum "
"MenuItems] enum."
msgstr "按标识符处理菜单选项。通常使用 [enum MenuItems] 中定义的 ID。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [method append_text] performs incremental re-parsing. Enable this for real-"
"time text streaming scenarios."
msgstr "为 [code]true[/code] 时，[method append_text] 使用增量解析。适用于需要实时显示流式文本的场景。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], a context menu with Copy and Select All options appears on right-click."
msgstr "为 [code]true[/code] 时，右键单击会显示含「复制」和「全选」的菜单。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], clicking an http/https link opens it in the system default browser."
msgstr "为 [code]true[/code] 时，点击 http/https 链接会使用系统默认浏览器打开。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], internal vertical scrolling is active."
msgstr "为 [code]true[/code] 时，启用内部垂直滚动。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], keyboard shortcuts (Ctrl+C, Ctrl+A) are handled by the control."
msgstr "为 [code]true[/code] 时，控件处理键盘快捷键（Ctrl+C、Ctrl+A）。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], renders closed fenced [code]mermaid[/code] blocks as diagrams using Merman."
" The rendering palette follows the luminance of the Markdown theme's text color. The editor's "
"Markdown preview enables this property.\n"
"The source code is displayed while rendering, after an error, or on builds without the Merman "
"backend. Text selection copies the diagram source."
msgstr ""
"为 [code]true[/code] 时，使用 Merman 将已闭合的 [code]mermaid[/code] 围栏代码块渲染为图表。图表配色取决于 Markdown "
"主题文字颜色的亮度。编辑器的 Markdown 预览会启用此属性。\n"
"渲染期间、渲染失败或构建中缺少 Merman 后端时显示图表源码。复制选区时会复制图表源码。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], selected text can be dragged and dropped to other controls."
msgstr "为 [code]true[/code] 时，可以将选中文本拖放到其他控件。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], streaming appends are parsed and laid out in batches instead of on every "
"[method append_text] call."
msgstr "为 [code]true[/code] 时，流式追加的内容分批解析和排版，无需每次调用 [method append_text] 时立即处理。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], text can be selected with the mouse."
msgstr "为 [code]true[/code] 时，可以用鼠标选择文本。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the control reports the rendered content height as its minimum height."
msgstr "为 [code]true[/code] 时，控件将渲染内容的高度作为最小高度。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the text selection is automatically cleared when the node loses focus."
msgstr "为 [code]true[/code] 时，节点失去焦点会自动清除选区。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the view follows appended content while the scroll bar is already at the "
"bottom."
msgstr "为 [code]true[/code] 时，如果滚动条已在底部，视图会跟随追加内容。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses [TeXRender] to render [code]$...$[/code] as inline math. A centered "
"display formula starts a line with [code]$$[/code] and ends the same or a later line with "
"[code]$$[/code].\n"
"Escape a literal dollar sign as [code]\\$[/code]. Inline code and fenced code keep their dollar "
"signs. If parsing a formula fails, its source is displayed as text. Text selection copies the "
"formula source, including its delimiters."
msgstr ""
"为 [code]true[/code] 时，使用 [TeXRender] 将 [code]$...$[/code] 渲染为行内公式。居中的块级公式从行首的 [code]$$[/code] "
"开始，并以同一行或后续行中的 [code]$$[/code] 结束。\n"
"使用 [code]\\$[/code] 转义美元符号。行内代码和围栏代码块中的美元符号按原文显示。解析公式失败时显示公式源码。复制选区时会保留公式源码及其定界符。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"If set to something other than [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF], rendered Markdown text wraps "
"inside the control bounds."
msgstr "设为 [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF] 以外的值时，渲染后的 Markdown 文本会在控件范围内换行。"

#. doc_classes/LatexDocument.xml
msgid "Imported LaTeX document."
msgstr "导入的 LaTeX 文档。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidDocument.xml
msgid "Imported Mermaid document."
msgstr "导入的 Mermaid 文档。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Inline math style."
msgstr "行内公式样式。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Lays out and draws a LaTeX math expression on a [CanvasItem]."
msgstr "在 [CanvasItem] 上排版并绘制 LaTeX 数学表达式。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Loads Markdown text from the file at [param path] and sets it as the document content. Returns "
"[constant OK] on success, or an error code such as [constant ERR_FILE_CANT_OPEN] if the file "
"could not be opened. Emits [signal text_changed] on success."
msgstr ""
"从 [param path] 指定的文件读取 Markdown 文本并设为文档内容。成功时返回 [constant OK]，并发出 [signal text_changed]。无法打开文件时返回"
" [constant ERR_FILE_CANT_OPEN] 等错误码。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Maintains the formula's apparent size as camera distance changes."
msgstr "摄像机距离改变时，保持公式的视觉大小。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"MarkdownLabel is a [Control] node that renders Markdown text. It provides scrolling, text "
"selection, text search, link click detection, and streaming text support suitable for real-time "
"output (e.g., AI chat).\n"
"\n"
"Supported Markdown features:\n"
"- ATX headings (h1–h6)\n"
"- Fenced code blocks with optional language tag\n"
"- Blockquotes (including nested)\n"
"- Ordered and unordered lists, task lists\n"
"- Thematic breaks (horizontal rules)\n"
"- Inline formatting: bold, italic, bold-italic, inline code, strikethrough, ==highlight==\n"
"- Links ([code][url]text[/url][/code]) and images\n"
"- Footnotes ([code][^id][/code] reference and [code][^id]: definition[/code])\n"
"- Tables\n"
"- LaTeX math when [member parse_latex] is enabled\n"
"- Mermaid diagrams when [member parse_mermaid] is enabled\n"
"\n"
"Markdown images and HTML [code]<img>[/code] elements shrink proportionally to fit the available "
"content width and height. With [member fit_content] enabled, the control grows vertically with "
"its content.\n"
"\n"
"[b]Streaming:[/b] When [member streaming_enabled] is [code]true[/code], [method append_text] "
"performs incremental re-parsing of only the unstable tail region (controlled by [member "
"max_unstable_lines]). Enable [member deferred_layout_enabled] to coalesce streaming layout "
"updates and minimum-size notifications. Call [method finish_stream] after the last append to "
"force a full re-parse for correct final layout.\n"
"\n"
"[b]Theme:[/b] All visual properties are read from the Godot theme system under the type name "
"[code]\"MarkdownLabel\"[/code]. See the project documentation for the complete list of theme "
"properties (fonts, font sizes, colors, styleboxes, constants, and icons).\n"
"\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This node programmatically creates its internal scroll container, margin container, "
"and canvas children in [constant Node.NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE]. Do not add child nodes manually."
msgstr ""
"MarkdownLabel 是渲染 Markdown 文本的 [Control] 节点。它支持滚动、文本选择、搜索、链接点击和适用于 AI 聊天等实时场景的流式输出。\n"
"\n"
"支持的 Markdown 语法：\n"
"- ATX 标题（h1 至 h6）\n"
"- 可指定语言的围栏代码块\n"
"- 引用块，包括嵌套引用\n"
"- 有序列表、无序列表和任务列表\n"
"- 分隔线\n"
"- 行内格式，包括粗体、斜体、粗斜体、行内代码、删除线和 ==高亮==\n"
"- 链接（[code][url]text[/url][/code]）和图片\n"
"- 脚注（[code][^id][/code] 引用和 [code][^id]: definition[/code] 定义）\n"
"- 表格\n"
"- 启用 [member parse_latex] 时支持 LaTeX 数学公式\n"
"- 启用 [member parse_mermaid] 时支持 Mermaid 图表\n"
"\n"
"Markdown 图片和 HTML [code]<img>[/code] 元素会等比缩小至可用内容宽高以内。开启 [member fit_content] 时，控件高度随内容增长。\n"
"\n"
"[b]流式输出：[/b] 当 [member streaming_enabled] 为 [code]true[/code] 时，[method append_text] "
"仅增量解析尚未稳定的末尾区域，其范围由 [member max_unstable_lines] 控制。启用 [member deferred_layout_enabled] "
"可合并流式排版更新和最小尺寸通知。最后一次追加后调用 [method finish_stream] 完整解析文档并生成最终布局。\n"
"\n"
"[b]主题：[/b] 所有视觉属性均从 Godot 主题中的 [code]\"MarkdownLabel\"[/code] 类型读取。完整的字体、字号、颜色、样式盒、常量和图标列表见项目文档。\n"
"\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 节点在 [constant Node.NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE] 时自动创建内部的滚动容器、边距容器和绘制子节点。请避免手动添加子节点。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Marks the layout as dirty and triggers a redraw. Call this after changing theme properties to "
"force a visual update."
msgstr "将布局标记为需要更新并触发重绘。主题属性改变后可调用此方法强制刷新。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum number of lines from the end of the document that are re-parsed on each [method "
"append_text] call in streaming mode. Clamped to [code][1, 256][/code]."
msgstr "流式模式下，每次调用 [method append_text] 最多从文档末尾重新解析的行数。取值限制在 [code][1, 256][/code]。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Minimum opacity for a texel to appear in alpha discard mode."
msgstr "Alpha 丢弃模式中保留纹素所需的最低不透明度。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Nested script math style."
msgstr "嵌套上下标样式。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Number of draw flags."
msgstr "绘制标志的数量。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid ""
"Offset from the node's origin in formula pixels. Positive X moves right and positive Y moves up "
"in local space."
msgstr "以公式像素为单位设置相对于节点原点的偏移。局部 X 轴正方向向右，Y 轴正方向向上。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid ""
"Places the formula's left edge, center, or right edge at the node's origin. Fill uses the center "
"for a single formula."
msgstr "将公式的左边缘、中心或右边缘对齐到节点原点。填充模式下，单个公式居中。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Places the formula's top edge, center, or bottom edge at the node's origin."
msgstr "将公式的上边缘、中心或下边缘对齐到节点原点。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid "Renders Mermaid diagrams and exposes Merman's diagram data."
msgstr "渲染 Mermaid 图表并提供 Merman 的图表数据。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces the current layout with the parsed LaTeX expression and returns [constant OK] on "
"success. Empty or whitespace-only input clears the layout and returns [constant OK]. A parse "
"error clears the layout and can be read with [method get_render_error]."
msgstr ""
"用解析后的 LaTeX 表达式替换当前布局。成功时返回 [constant OK]。空输入或仅含空白的输入会清除布局并返回 [constant OK]。解析错误也会清除布局，错误信息可通过 "
"[method get_render_error] 读取。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Represents the total number of menu items. Used for bounds checking."
msgstr "菜单项总数，用于检查索引范围。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid ""
"Resolution multiplier for the formula texture, from [code]1.0[/code] to [code]4.0[/code]. The "
"formula's layout, alignment, and size in 3D stay the same. The longest texture edge is capped at "
"4096 pixels."
msgstr "公式纹理的分辨率倍率，范围为 [code]1.0[/code] 至 [code]4.0[/code]。3D 中的排版、对齐和尺寸由公式的逻辑尺寸决定。纹理长边上限为 4096 像素。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid ""
"Returns Merman's runtime catalog, including supported operation IDs in "
"[code]capabilities.operation_ids[/code]. Returns an empty dictionary when the backend is "
"unavailable."
msgstr "返回 Merman 的运行时目录。支持的操作 ID 位于 [code]capabilities.operation_ids[/code]。后端不可用时返回空字典。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid "Returns SVG, ASCII, or JSON output as a string. Returns an empty string for binary output."
msgstr "以字符串形式返回 SVG、ASCII 或 JSON 输出。二进制输出返回空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if a formula layout is available."
msgstr "有可用的公式布局时返回 [code]true[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if drag-and-drop of selected text is enabled. The default value is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr "允许拖放选中的文本时返回 [code]true[/code]。默认值为 [code]true[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if external links (http/https) are automatically opened in the system "
"browser."
msgstr "外部链接（http/https）会自动在系统浏览器中打开时，返回 [code]true[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if internal vertical scrolling is active."
msgstr "内部垂直滚动已启用时，返回 [code]true[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if keyboard shortcuts (Ctrl+C, Ctrl+A) are enabled. The default value "
"is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr "启用键盘快捷键（Ctrl+C、Ctrl+A）时返回 [code]true[/code]。默认值为 [code]true[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if scroll following for visible-character reveals is enabled. "
"MarkdownLabel currently exposes this for RichTextLabel API parity; it has no effect until "
"visible-character clipping is implemented."
msgstr "启用逐字显示时的滚动跟随，则返回 [code]true[/code]。MarkdownLabel 提供此属性以兼容 RichTextLabel API。实现按可见字符数裁剪前，该属性没有效果。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if streaming layout updates are coalesced instead of being applied on "
"every [method append_text] call."
msgstr "流式排版更新会合并处理时，返回 [code]true[/code]。启用后每次调用 [method append_text] 时无需立即更新布局。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if streaming mode is enabled. The default value is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr "启用流式模式时返回 [code]true[/code]。默认值为 [code]false[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if text selection is enabled. The default value is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr "启用文本选择时返回 [code]true[/code]。默认值为 [code]true[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the context menu is currently visible."
msgstr "右键菜单当前可见时返回 [code]true[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the control reports its rendered content height as its minimum "
"height."
msgstr "控件将已渲染内容的高度作为最小高度时，返回 [code]true[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the document contains a Markdown heading anchor or a laid-out HTML "
"element with the given ID."
msgstr "文档中存在指定 ID 的 Markdown 标题锚点或已排版的 HTML 元素时，返回 [code]true[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the right-click context menu is enabled. The default value is "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr "启用右键菜单时返回 [code]true[/code]。默认值为 [code]false[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the selection is automatically cleared when the node loses focus. "
"The default value is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr "节点失去焦点时会自动清除选区，则返回 [code]true[/code]。默认值为 [code]true[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the view follows appended content when it is already scrolled to the"
" bottom."
msgstr "视图位于底部并跟随新追加内容滚动时，返回 [code]true[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of Merman's metadata or structured error details for the last operation. For JSON "
"operations, read the operation's data with [method get_output_text]."
msgstr "返回上次操作的 Merman 元数据副本或结构化错误详情。JSON 操作的数据可通过 [method get_output_text] 读取。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the URI of the link at the given local position (relative to the MarkdownLabel), or an "
"empty string if no link is under the position."
msgstr "返回指定局部坐标处的链接 URI，坐标相对于 MarkdownLabel。该位置没有链接时返回空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the additional font size added to all text in the document. The default value is "
"[code]0[/code]."
msgstr "返回应用于文档全部文本的额外字号。默认值为 [code]0[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Returns the autowrap space trimming flags."
msgstr "返回自动换行时的空格裁剪标志。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the baseline position as a fraction of the layout height. Returns [code]0.0[/code] for an"
" empty layout."
msgstr "返回基线位置占布局高度的比例。布局为空时返回 [code]0.0[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Returns the configured foreground color."
msgstr "返回设置的前景色。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Returns the content margin in pixels. The default value is [code]16[/code]."
msgstr "返回内容边距，单位为像素。默认值为 [code]16[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Returns the current autowrap mode. The default value is [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_WORD_SMART]."
msgstr "返回当前自动换行模式。默认值为 [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_WORD_SMART]。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the current diagram's rendering error. Returns an empty string while rendering or when "
"there is no error."
msgstr "返回当前图表的渲染错误。渲染期间或没有错误时返回空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Returns the current raw Markdown text."
msgstr "返回当前的 Markdown 源文本。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Returns the current text size in pixels, or [code]0.0[/code] when there is no layout."
msgstr "返回当前字号，单位为像素。没有布局时返回 [code]0.0[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Returns the currently selected plain text, or an empty string if nothing is selected."
msgstr "返回当前选中的纯文本。未选中文本时返回空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the deferred streaming layout flush interval in milliseconds. The default value is "
"[code]33[/code]."
msgstr "返回延迟流式排版的刷新间隔，单位为毫秒。默认值为 [code]33[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Returns the depth below the baseline in pixels, including any bottom inset and padding."
msgstr "返回基线下方的深度，单位为像素，包含底部内嵌距和留白。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the diagnostic message for the last failed operation. Returns an empty string after a "
"successful operation."
msgstr "返回最近一次失败操作的诊断信息。操作成功时返回空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the distance from the top of the layout to its baseline in pixels, measured using the "
"layout's integer height."
msgstr "返回布局顶部到基线的距离，单位为像素，按布局的整数高度计算。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the effective insets in left, top, right, bottom order. Includes MicroTeX's automatic "
"insets when enabled."
msgstr "按左、上、右、下的顺序返回实际内嵌距。启用自动内嵌距时包含 MicroTeX 添加的部分。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the error from the last attempt to lay out [member text]. Returns an empty string if the "
"expression rendered successfully or is empty. The label lays out its expression after entering "
"the scene tree."
msgstr "返回上次排版 [member text] 时的错误。表达式为空或渲染成功时返回空字符串。标签进入场景树后才会排版。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the error from the last layout update, or an empty string on success. Formula changes are"
" applied on a deferred update."
msgstr "返回上次排版更新的错误信息。排版成功时返回空字符串。公式改动会在延迟更新时应用。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Returns the error message from the last parse attempt, or an empty string on success."
msgstr "返回上次解析的错误信息。解析成功时返回空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/LatexDocument.xml
#. doc_classes/MermaidDocument.xml
msgid "Returns the imported source text, including its original line breaks."
msgstr "返回导入的源文本，保留原有换行。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the internal [PopupMenu] used for the context menu. The menu is lazily created on first "
"access."
msgstr "返回右键菜单使用的内部 [PopupMenu]。首次访问时创建。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the internal horizontal scroll bar, or [code]null[/code] if the control has not been "
"created yet. Typically not useful since horizontal scrolling is disabled by default."
msgstr "返回内部水平滚动条。控件尚未创建时返回 [code]null[/code]。水平滚动默认禁用。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the internal vertical scroll bar, or [code]null[/code] if the control has not been "
"created yet."
msgstr "返回内部垂直滚动条。控件尚未创建时返回 [code]null[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Returns the list of Markdown heading anchors and IDs from laid-out HTML blocks in the document."
msgstr "返回文档中的 Markdown 标题锚点和已排版的 HTML 块内的元素 ID。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum number of unstable lines used for incremental re-parsing. The default value "
"is [code]32[/code]."
msgstr "返回增量解析使用的最大未稳定行数。默认值为 [code]32[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid "Returns the media type of the current output, such as [code]image/png[/code]."
msgstr "返回当前输出的媒体类型，例如 [code]image/png[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of rendered top-level Markdown blocks, or [code]0[/code] if the canvas has not"
" been created yet."
msgstr "返回已渲染的顶层 Markdown 块数量。绘制节点尚未创建时返回 [code]0[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid "Returns the raw output bytes of the last successful operation."
msgstr "返回最近一次成功操作的原始输出字节。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the texture of the current diagram. Returns [code]null[/code] until a diagram renders "
"successfully. The texture has twice the logical display resolution."
msgstr "返回当前图表的纹理。在图表成功渲染前返回 [code]null[/code]。纹理分辨率是逻辑显示分辨率的两倍。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the total content height in pixels, or [code]1.0[/code] if the canvas has not been "
"created yet."
msgstr "返回内容总高度，单位为像素。绘制节点尚未创建时返回 [code]1.0[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Returns the total layout height in pixels."
msgstr "返回布局的总高度，单位为像素。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Returns the total layout size in pixels."
msgstr "返回布局总尺寸，单位为像素。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Returns the total layout width in pixels."
msgstr "返回布局的总宽度，单位为像素。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidRender.xml
msgid "Returns whether the Merman backend is available in this build."
msgstr "返回当前构建是否支持 Merman 后端。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Returns whether the specified draw flag is enabled."
msgstr "返回指定的绘制标志是否已启用。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Sampling filter for the formula texture."
msgstr "公式纹理的采样滤镜。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Scale of the transparency pattern in alpha hash mode."
msgstr "Alpha 哈希模式中透明图案的缩放比例。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Scales the current formula to [param text_size] pixels. Insets keep their current pixel values."
msgstr "将当前公式缩放至 [param text_size] 像素。内嵌距保留当前像素值。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid "Script math style."
msgstr "上下标样式。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Scrolls to the current search result (set by a previous [method search] call). [param align] "
"controls where the result appears in the viewport: [code]0.0[/code] (top) to [code]1.0[/code] "
"(bottom). Returns [code]false[/code] if there is no active search result."
msgstr ""
"滚动到当前搜索结果，由先前的 [method search] 调用设置。[param align] 控制结果在视口中的位置，从 [code]0.0[/code]（顶部）到 "
"[code]1.0[/code]（底部）。没有当前搜索结果时返回 [code]false[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Scrolls to the first Markdown heading or laid-out HTML element with the given anchor ID. Pass the"
" case-sensitive ID without [code]#[/code]. [param align] ranges from [code]0.0[/code] at the top "
"of the viewport to [code]1.0[/code] at the bottom. With [member fit_content] enabled, this "
"scrolls the nearest ancestor [ScrollContainer] with vertical scrolling enabled, when present. "
"Returns [code]false[/code] if the anchor does not exist."
msgstr "滚动到第一个具有指定锚点 ID 的 Markdown 标题或已排版的 HTML 元素。ID 区分大小写，传入时省略 [code]#[/code]。"
"[param align] 从视口顶部的 [code]0.0[/code] 到底部的 [code]1.0[/code]。启用 [member fit_content] 后，"
"会滚动最近的启用了垂直滚动的祖先 [ScrollContainer]。锚点不存在时返回 [code]false[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Searches the document for [param text] starting from ([param from_line], [param from_column]). "
"[param flags] is a bitmask: [code]1[/code] = match case, [code]2[/code] = whole words, "
"[code]4[/code] = search backwards. Returns the line and column of the match as a [Vector2i], or "
"[code]Vector2i(-1, -1)[/code] if no match was found. The match is highlighted on screen."
msgstr ""
"从 ([param from_line], [param from_column]) 开始查找 [param text]。[param flags] 是位掩码：[code]1[/code] "
"表示区分大小写，[code]2[/code] 表示匹配整个单词，[code]4[/code] 表示向后搜索。返回匹配位置的行列坐标 [Vector2i]，没有匹配时返回 "
"[code]Vector2i(-1, -1)[/code]。匹配结果会在控件中高亮显示。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Selects all text in the document."
msgstr "选中文档中的所有文本。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid ""
"Set [member text] to a formula such as [code]\\"
"frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}[/code]. [TeXRender] lays "
"out the formula and draws it to a transparent texture. The node displays the texture on a quad "
"facing local [code]+Z[/code].\n"
"[member font_size] sets the formula size in pixels and [member pixel_size] converts formula "
"pixels into local 3D units. Texture resolution is capped at 4096 pixels on its longest edge. The "
"node regenerates its mesh from the formula when entering the scene tree or when the text changes."
msgstr ""
"将 [member text] 设为公式，例如 [code]\\"
"frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}[/code]。[TeXRender] 将公式排版后绘制到透明纹理。节点在面向局部 "
"[code]+Z[/code] 的四边形上显示该纹理。\n"
"[member font_size] 设置公式的像素字号，[member pixel_size] 将公式像素换算为局部 3D 单位。纹理的最长边最多为 4096 "
"像素。进入场景树或文本变化时，节点会按公式重新生成网格。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Sets an additional font size added to all text in the document. Clamped to the range [code][0, "
"16][/code]. Emits [signal extra_font_size_changed]."
msgstr "为文档中所有文本设置额外字号。取值限制在 [code][0, 16][/code]，并发出 [signal extra_font_size_changed]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Sets autowrap space trimming flags. Only trim flags are stored."
msgstr "设置自动换行的空格裁剪标志。仅保存与空格裁剪相关的标志。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Sets how often deferred streaming layout updates are flushed. Clamped to the range [code][1, "
"1000][/code]. The default value is [code]33[/code]."
msgstr "设置执行延迟流式排版更新的间隔。取值限制在 [code][1, 1000][/code]。默认值为 [code]33[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Sets how rendered Markdown text wraps inside the control bounds."
msgstr "设置渲染后的 Markdown 文本如何在控件范围内换行。"

#. doc_classes/TeXRender.xml
msgid ""
"Sets insets in left, top, right, bottom order. When [param true_values] is [code]false[/code], "
"MicroTeX adds its automatic padding to the specified values. Pass [code]Vector4i(0, 0, 0, 0), "
"true[/code] for tight inline layout."
msgstr ""
"按左、上、右、下的顺序设置内嵌距。[param true_values] 为 [code]false[/code] 时，MicroTeX 会在指定值上加上自动留白。传入 "
"[code]Vector4i(0, 0, 0, 0), true[/code] 可获得紧凑的行内布局。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the Markdown text to render. Emits [signal text_changed]. Resets the current selection and "
"search state."
msgstr "设置要渲染的 Markdown 文本。发出 [signal text_changed]，并重置选区和搜索状态。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the content margin in pixels. Clamped to the range [code][0, 128][/code]. The default value "
"is [code]16[/code]."
msgstr "设置内容边距，单位为像素。取值限制在 [code][0, 128][/code]。默认值为 [code]16[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of unstable lines for incremental re-parsing in streaming mode. Clamped "
"to the range [code][1, 256][/code]. The default value is [code]32[/code]."
msgstr "设置流式模式下增量解析使用的最大未稳定行数。取值限制在 [code][1, 256][/code]。默认值为 [code]32[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Sets whether drag-and-drop of selected text is enabled."
msgstr "设置是否允许拖放选中的文本。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether external links (http/https) are automatically opened in the system default browser "
"when clicked."
msgstr "设置点击外部链接（http/https）时是否自动使用系统默认浏览器打开。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether internal vertical scrolling is active. When disabled, the internal vertical scroll "
"mode is disabled."
msgstr "设置是否启用内部垂直滚动。关闭后会禁用内部垂直滚动模式。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Sets whether keyboard shortcuts (Ctrl+C to copy, Ctrl+A to select all) are enabled."
msgstr "设置是否启用键盘快捷键（Ctrl+C 复制，Ctrl+A 全选）。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether scroll following for visible-character reveals is enabled. MarkdownLabel currently "
"exposes this for RichTextLabel API parity; it has no effect until visible-character clipping is "
"implemented."
msgstr "设置是否启用逐字显示时的滚动跟随。MarkdownLabel 提供此属性以兼容 RichTextLabel API。实现按可见字符数裁剪前，该属性没有效果。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether streaming layout updates are deferred and coalesced. This is useful for AI-style "
"token streaming, especially when [member fit_content] is enabled."
msgstr "设置是否延迟并合并流式排版更新。适用于 AI 聊天等逐段流式输出，尤其是在启用 [member fit_content] 时。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether streaming mode is enabled. When [code]true[/code], [method append_text] performs "
"incremental re-parsing for better performance with real-time text output."
msgstr "设置是否启用流式模式。设为 [code]true[/code] 时，[method append_text] 会增量解析，以提升实时输出性能。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Sets whether text selection with the mouse is enabled."
msgstr "设置是否允许用鼠标选择文本。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Sets whether the control reports its rendered content height as its minimum height."
msgstr "设置控件是否将已渲染内容的高度作为最小高度。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Sets whether the right-click context menu is enabled."
msgstr "设置是否启用右键菜单。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Sets whether the text selection is automatically cleared when the node loses focus."
msgstr "设置节点失去焦点时是否自动清除选区。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "Sets whether the view follows newly appended content when the scroll bar is already at the bottom."
msgstr "设置滚动条已在底部时视图是否跟随新追加的内容滚动。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Size of a formula pixel in local 3D units."
msgstr "单个公式像素在局部 3D 空间中的尺寸。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid "Solid outline color of diagram nodes."
msgstr "图表节点的纯色描边。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Sort priority of the formula's material."
msgstr "公式材质的渲染排序优先级。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The LaTeX expression to display. Supply the formula directly, for example [code]\\sum_{n=1}^{10} "
"n^2[/code]."
msgstr "要显示的 LaTeX 表达式。直接填写公式源码，例如 [code]\\sum_{n=1}^{10} n^2[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "The LaTeX expression to display. Use the formula source directly."
msgstr "要显示的 LaTeX 表达式。直接填写公式源码。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid "The Markdown text to render. Setting this property resets the selection and search state."
msgstr "要渲染的 Markdown 文本。设置此属性会重置选区和搜索状态。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid "The Mermaid diagram source, for example [code]flowchart LR; A[Start] --> B[Done][/code]."
msgstr "Mermaid 图表源码，例如 [code]flowchart LR; A[Start] --> B[Done][/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"The content margin in pixels. Controls the padding between the MarkdownLabel edges and the "
"rendered content."
msgstr "内容边距，单位为像素。控制 MarkdownLabel 边缘与渲染内容之间的留白。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid "The default palette for the diagram."
msgstr "图表的默认配色。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidDocument.xml
msgid ""
"The editor imports UTF-8 [code].mmd[/code] files as [MermaidDocument] resources. Use [method "
"get_text] to read the Mermaid source."
msgstr ""
"编辑器会将 UTF-8 编码的 [code].mmd[/code] 文件导入为 [MermaidDocument] 资源。使用 [method get_text]"
" 读取 Mermaid 源文本。"

#. doc_classes/LatexDocument.xml
msgid ""
"The editor imports UTF-8 [code].tex[/code] files as [LatexDocument] resources. Use [method "
"get_text] to read the LaTeX source."
msgstr ""
"编辑器会将 UTF-8 编码的 [code].tex[/code] 文件导入为 [LatexDocument] 资源。使用 [method get_text] "
"读取 LaTeX 源文本。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Tints the entire formula, including colors specified inside it."
msgstr "为整个公式着色，包括公式内部指定了颜色的部分。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Uses a dither pattern for transparency."
msgstr "使用抖动图案表现透明度。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel3D.xml
msgid "Uses display math style when enabled and the compact inline math style when disabled."
msgstr "启用时使用独立公式样式，关闭时使用紧凑的行内公式样式。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
msgid "Uses display math style when enabled and the more compact inline math style when disabled."
msgstr "启用时使用独立公式样式，关闭时使用更紧凑的行内公式样式。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid "Uses the dark palette."
msgstr "使用深色配色。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Uses the light palette with a dark theme font color and the dark palette with a light theme font "
"color."
msgstr "主题字体颜色较深时使用浅色配色，颜色较浅时使用深色配色。"

#. doc_classes/MermaidLabel.xml
msgid "Uses the light palette."
msgstr "使用浅色配色。"

#. doc_classes/LatexLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Uses the resource's font size and font color in preference to the theme. Changes to a shared "
"resource update the formula. The glyphs use the embedded math fonts."
msgstr "优先使用该资源的字号和字体颜色。共享资源发生变化时会更新公式。公式字形来自内置数学字体。"

#. doc_classes/PDFTexture.xml
msgid "A texture imported from a single PDF page."
msgstr "从单页 PDF 导入的纹理。"

#. doc_classes/PDFTexture.xml
msgid ""
"The Windows x64 editor can import a [code].pdf[/code] file as a [PDFTexture]. Select the page "
"and DPI in the Import dock, then use the resource anywhere a [Texture2D] is accepted. Exported "
"projects load the baked pixels without PDFium."
msgstr ""
"Windows x64 编辑器可以将 [code].pdf[/code] 文件导入为 [PDFTexture]。在导入面板中选择页码和 DPI 后，"
"即可在接受 [Texture2D] 的位置使用该资源。导出的项目直接加载烘焙后的像素，无需 PDFium。"

#. doc_classes/PDFTexture.xml
msgid "The resolution in dots per inch used to render the imported page."
msgstr "渲染导入页面时使用的分辨率，单位为每英寸点数。"

#. doc_classes/PDFTexture.xml
msgid "The imported page number, starting at 1."
msgstr "导入的页码，从 1 开始。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Allows consecutive search matches to overlap."
msgstr "允许连续搜索结果相互重叠。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Reads the string or name at PDF dictionary [param key] on "
"annotation [param annotation_index] of [param page_index]. Returns an empty string when the value"
" is absent."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]annotations[/code]。读取 [param page_index] 上索引为 [param annotation_index] 的注释字典中 [param "
"key] 对应的字符串或名称。缺少该值时返回空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Returns annotations on [param page_index] with available "
"fields [code]index, subtype, flags, author, contents, subject, modified, rect, color, "
"interior_color, quads, vertices, ink_paths, line, border[/code]. Border components are horizontal"
" radius, vertical radius and width."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]annotations[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 上的注释及可用字段 [code]index, subtype, flags, author, "
"contents, subject, modified, rect, color, interior_color, quads, vertices, ink_paths, line, "
"border[/code]。边框分量依次为水平半径、垂直半径和宽度。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]attachments[/code]. Returns attachment metadata with available fields "
"[code]index, name, description, mime_type, relationship, size, CreationDate, ModDate, "
"CheckSum[/code]. The size is in bytes."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]attachments[/code]。返回附件元数据及可用字段 [code]index, name, description, mime_type, relationship,"
" size, CreationDate, ModDate, CheckSum[/code]。大小以字节为单位。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]attachments[/code]. Returns the decoded contents of attachment [param index] as "
"bytes."
msgstr "能力 [code]attachments[/code]。返回附件 [param index] 解码后的内容字节。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]core[/code]. Converts [param position] from the full bitmap at [param dpi] and "
"additional [param rotation] to a PDF point on [param page_index]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]core[/code]。将指定 [param dpi] 和额外 [param rotation] 下的整页位图像素坐标 [param position] 转换为 [param "
"page_index] 上的 PDF 点坐标。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]core[/code]. Converts a PDF point [param position] on [param page_index] to an "
"integer pixel position in the full bitmap at [param dpi] and additional [param rotation]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]core[/code]。将 [param page_index] 上的 PDF 点坐标 [param position] 转换为指定 [param dpi] 和额外 "
"[param rotation] 下的整页位图整数像素坐标。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]core[/code]. Renders [param page_index] at [param dpi] to an RGBA8 image over "
"[param background]. Use [param flags] from [enum RenderFlags]. Additional clockwise [param "
"rotation] must be 0, 90, 180, or 270 degrees. Output is limited to 8192 pixels per side and 64 "
"MiB. Form widgets require [code]forms[/code]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]core[/code]。以 [param dpi] 将 [param page_index] 渲染为 RGBA8 图像，底色为 [param "
"background]。[param flags] 使用 [enum RenderFlags] 中的标志。额外顺时针旋转 [param rotation] 可以是 0、90、180 或 270 "
"度。输出单边最长为 8192 像素，大小上限为 64 MiB。绘制表单控件需要 [code]forms[/code] 能力。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]core[/code]. Renders only [param region] of [param page_index]. Measure the "
"region from the top-left of the full bitmap at [param dpi] and additional [param rotation]. The "
"region must be inside the full page. The bitmap limits, [param flags] and [param background] work"
" as in [method render_page]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]core[/code]。只渲染 [param page_index] 的 [param region]。区域以指定 [param dpi] 和额外 [param "
"rotation] 下的整页位图左上角为原点，且必须位于整页范围内。位图限制、[param flags] 和 [param background] 与 [method render_page] "
"相同。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Capability [code]core[/code]. Returns the number of pages in the open document."
msgstr "能力 [code]core[/code]。返回当前文档的页数。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]document[/code]. Returns [code]page_index, size_pt, rotation, has_transparency, "
"label, boxes[/code] for [param page_index]. Rotation is in clockwise degrees. The "
"[code]boxes[/code] dictionary contains any available PDF point rectangles [code]media, crop, "
"bleed, trim, art, bounds[/code]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]document[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 对应的 [code]page_index, size_pt, rotation, "
"has_transparency, label, boxes[/code]。旋转角度以顺时针为正。[code]boxes[/code] 字典包含可用的 PDF 点坐标矩形 "
"[code]media, crop, bleed, trim, art, bounds[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]document[/code]. Returns [code]version[/code] (e.g. 17 for PDF 1.7), "
"[code]page_count[/code], [code]valid_cross_reference_table[/code], [code]permissions[/code], "
"[code]user_permissions[/code], [code]security_handler_revision[/code], [code]form_type[/code], "
"[code]tagged[/code], [code]language[/code], [code]permanent_id[/code], [code]changing_id[/code], "
"[code]trailer_ends[/code] and [code]viewer_preferences[/code]. Viewer preferences contain "
"[code]print_scaling[/code], [code]copies[/code], [code]duplex[/code] and "
"[code]print_page_range[/code]. File identifiers are raw bytes."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]document[/code]。返回 [code]version[/code]（例如 PDF 1.7 的值为 "
"17）、[code]page_count[/code]、[code]valid_cross_reference_table[/code]、[code]permissions[/code]、[code]user_permissions[/code]、[code]security_handler_revision[/code]、[code]form_type[/code]、[code]tagged[/code]、[code]language[/code]、[code]permanent_id[/code]、[code]changing_id[/code]、[code]trailer_ends[/code]"
" 和 [code]viewer_preferences[/code]。查看器偏好包括 "
"[code]print_scaling[/code]、[code]copies[/code]、[code]duplex[/code] 和 "
"[code]print_page_range[/code]。文件标识为原始字节。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]document[/code]. Returns the available PDF information dictionary strings "
"[code]Title, Author, Subject, Keywords, Creator, Producer, CreationDate, ModDate[/code]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]document[/code]。返回 PDF 信息字典中可用的字符串 [code]Title, Author, Subject, Keywords, Creator, "
"Producer, CreationDate, ModDate[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]forms[/code]. Returns AcroForm widgets on [param page_index] with "
"[code]annotation_index, name, alternate_name, value, export_value, type, flags, checked, rect, "
"options[/code]. Each option contains [code]index, label, selected[/code]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]forms[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 上的 AcroForm 控件，字段为 [code]annotation_index, name, "
"alternate_name, value, export_value, type, flags, checked, rect, options[/code]。每个选项包含 "
"[code]index, label, selected[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]javascript[/code]. Returns document JavaScript actions with [code]index, name, "
"script[/code]. The script is returned as text."
msgstr "能力 [code]javascript[/code]。返回文档 JavaScript 动作的 [code]index, name, script[/code]，其中脚本以文本形式返回。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]navigation[/code]. Returns a bookmark tree. Each entry contains [code]title, "
"count, style, destination, action, children[/code] and optional [code]color[/code]. Destinations "
"and actions use the fields described in [method get_page_links]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]navigation[/code]。返回书签树。每个条目包含 [code]title, count, style, destination, action, "
"children[/code] 及可选的 [code]color[/code]。目标和动作字段参见 [method get_page_links]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]navigation[/code]. Returns destination dictionaries with [code]name[/code] and "
"the fields described in [method get_page_links]."
msgstr "能力 [code]navigation[/code]。返回目标字典数组，包含 [code]name[/code] 及 [method get_page_links] 所述字段。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]navigation[/code]. Returns explicit links on [param page_index] with [code]rect,"
" quads, destination, action[/code]. A destination can contain [code]page_index, view, parameters,"
" x, y, zoom[/code]. An action can contain [code]type, uri, file_path, destination[/code]. The "
"type and view are PDFium numeric codes. A remote destination may lack a resolvable page index."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]navigation[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 上的显式链接，字段为 [code]rect, quads, destination, "
"action[/code]。目标可包含 [code]page_index, view, parameters, x, y, zoom[/code]。动作可包含 [code]type, uri, "
"file_path, destination[/code]。类型和视图采用 PDFium 数值代码。远程目标可能没有可解析的页索引。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]page_objects[/code]. Returns a tree of objects on [param page_index]. Common "
"fields are [code]path, type, marked_content_id, has_transparency, active, bounds, rotated_bounds,"
" transform, fill_color, stroke_color, stroke_width, line_join, line_cap, dash_phase, "
"dash_array[/code]. Text adds [code]text, font_size, text_render_mode, font[/code]. Font fields "
"are [code]family, base_name, embedded, flags, weight[/code]. Paths add [code]segments, fill_mode,"
" stroke[/code] and each segment has [code]type, point, close[/code]. Images add [code]pixel_size,"
" dpi, bits_per_pixel, color_space, filters[/code]. Form objects add [code]children[/code]. Use "
"[code]path[/code] for follow-up extraction."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]page_objects[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 的对象树。通用字段为 [code]path, type, "
"marked_content_id, has_transparency, active, bounds, rotated_bounds, transform, fill_color, "
"stroke_color, stroke_width, line_join, line_cap, dash_phase, dash_array[/code]。文本还包括 [code]text, "
"font_size, text_render_mode, font[/code]，字体字段为 [code]family, base_name, embedded, flags, "
"weight[/code]。路径还包括 [code]segments, fill_mode, stroke[/code]，各线段包含 [code]type, point, "
"close[/code]。图像还包括 [code]pixel_size, dpi, bits_per_pixel, color_space, filters[/code]。表单对象还包括 "
"[code]children[/code]。可使用 [code]path[/code] 进一步提取对象数据。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]page_objects[/code]. Returns an RGBA8 image for the image object at [param "
"object_path] on [param page_index]. Enable [param rendered] to include the image matrix and mask."
" The bitmap limits from [method render_page] apply."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]page_objects[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 上 [param object_path] 对应图像对象的 RGBA8 图像。启用 "
"[param rendered] 时应用图像矩阵和遮罩。位图限制与 [method render_page] 相同。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]page_objects[/code]. Returns stream bytes for the image object at [param "
"object_path] on [param page_index]. Enable [param decoded] to apply the PDF stream filters that "
"PDFium supports for this API."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]page_objects[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 上 [param object_path] 对应图像对象的流字节。启用 [param "
"decoded] 时应用 PDFium 在此接口中支持的 PDF 流过滤器。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]page_objects[/code]. Returns the font program bytes PDFium uses for the text "
"object at [param object_path] on [param page_index]."
msgstr "能力 [code]page_objects[/code]。返回 PDFium 为 [param page_index] 上 [param object_path] 对应文本对象使用的字体程序字节。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]signatures[/code]. Returns [code]index, subfilter, time, reason, "
"doc_mdp_permission, byte_range[/code] for each signature. The byte range contains alternating "
"offsets and lengths."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]signatures[/code]。返回各签名的 [code]index, subfilter, time, reason, doc_mdp_permission, "
"byte_range[/code]。字节范围由偏移量和长度交替组成。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]signatures[/code]. Returns the raw PDF signature contents at [param index] for "
"inspection."
msgstr "能力 [code]signatures[/code]。返回签名 [param index] 的 PDF 原始内容，供调用方检查。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]structure[/code]. Returns the tagged structure tree for [param page_index]. "
"Element fields are [code]type, title, alt_text, actual_text, language, id, expansion, "
"marked_content_id, marked_content_ids, attributes, children[/code]. Marked-content children may "
"contain just [code]marked_content_id[/code]. Attribute dictionaries map names to a "
"[code]type[/code] code and an optional [code]value[/code]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]structure[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 的标签结构树。元素字段为 [code]type, title, alt_text, "
"actual_text, language, id, expansion, marked_content_id, marked_content_ids, attributes, "
"children[/code]。标记内容子项可能仅含 [code]marked_content_id[/code]。属性字典以名称为键，每项包含 [code]type[/code] 代码和可选的"
" [code]value[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]text[/code]. Counts PDFium character indices on [param page_index], including "
"generated separators."
msgstr "能力 [code]text[/code]。统计 [param page_index] 的 PDFium 字符索引数量，包含生成的分隔符。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]text[/code]. Finds Unicode [param query] on [param page_index] using [param "
"flags] from [enum FindFlags]. Each match contains [code]start[/code] and [code]count[/code] in "
"PDFium characters and [code]rects[/code] in PDF points."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]text[/code]。使用 [enum FindFlags] 中的 [param flags] 在 [param page_index] 搜索 Unicode [param "
"query]。每项结果包含 PDFium 字符索引 [code]start[/code]、数量 [code]count[/code] 及 PDF 点坐标矩形 "
"[code]rects[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]text[/code]. Finds the character index near [param position] on [param "
"page_index] within the horizontal and vertical [param tolerance] in points. Returns -1 on a miss "
"or error."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]text[/code]。按 [param tolerance] 给出的水平和垂直点坐标容差，查找 [param page_index] 上接近 [param position]"
" 的字符索引。未命中或出错时返回 -1。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]text[/code]. Returns PDF point rectangles for [param count] characters starting "
"at [param start] on [param page_index]. A count of -1 selects to the end."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]text[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 上从 [param start] 开始的 [param count] 个字符所对应的 PDF "
"点坐标矩形。数量为 -1 时选择到末尾。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]text[/code]. Returns Unicode text on [param page_index] from [param start] for "
"[param count] PDFium characters. A count of -1 reads to the end. Unmapped characters can be "
"omitted from the resulting string."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]text[/code]。读取 [param page_index] 上从 [param start] 开始的 [param count] 个 PDFium 字符，返回 "
"Unicode 文本。数量为 -1 时读取到末尾。返回字符串中可能省略无映射字符。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]text[/code]. Returns Unicode text within the PDF point [param rect] on [param "
"page_index]."
msgstr "能力 [code]text[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 上 PDF 点坐标矩形 [param rect] 内的 Unicode 文本。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]text[/code]. Returns character data for [param char_index] on [param "
"page_index]. Fields include [code]index, unicode, generated, hyphen, unicode_map_error, angle, "
"font_size, font_weight, font_name, font_flags, bounds, loose_bounds, origin, transform, "
"fill_color, stroke_color[/code]. The angle is in radians."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]text[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 上 [param char_index] 对应的字符数据。字段包括 [code]index, "
"unicode, generated, hyphen, unicode_map_error, angle, font_size, font_weight, font_name, "
"font_flags, bounds, loose_bounds, origin, transform, fill_color, stroke_color[/code]。角度以弧度为单位。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]thumbnail[/code]. Returns the embedded thumbnail for [param page_index] as "
"RGBA8, or [code]null[/code] if the page has none."
msgstr "能力 [code]thumbnail[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 的 RGBA8 内嵌缩略图。页面没有缩略图时返回 [code]null[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]web_links[/code]. Returns URLs detected in the text on [param page_index]. "
"Entries contain [code]uri, rects, start, count[/code]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]web_links[/code]。返回从 [param page_index] 文本中识别出的 URL。每项包含 [code]uri, rects, start, "
"count[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]xfa[/code]. Returns embedded XFA packets with [code]index, name, data[/code]. "
"Packet data is returned as bytes."
msgstr "能力 [code]xfa[/code]。返回内嵌 XFA 数据包的 [code]index, name, data[/code]，其中数据以字节形式返回。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Closes the current document and clears the last error. Safe to call repeatedly."
msgstr "关闭当前文档并清除错误。可重复调用。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Disables native text output."
msgstr "禁用原生文字输出。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Disables smoothing for images."
msgstr "禁用图像平滑。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Disables smoothing for paths."
msgstr "禁用路径平滑。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Disables smoothing for text."
msgstr "禁用文字平滑。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Draws AcroForm widget appearances."
msgstr "绘制 AcroForm 控件外观。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Draws ordinary page annotations."
msgstr "绘制普通页面注释。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Each reader holds one document. Pages, characters, attachments, signatures and object paths use "
"zero-based indices. Geometry uses native PDF point coordinates with Y increasing upward. Pixel "
"coordinates use the top-left of the full rendered page. Results are Godot values and remain "
"usable after [method close].\n"
"Check [method get_capabilities] to discover available groups. A missing capability sets [constant"
" ERR_UNAVAILABLE]. If the document has no matching content, the method returns an empty result "
"with [constant OK]. Use [method get_last_error] to distinguish these cases. Fields for absent "
"optional data may be omitted.\n"
"PDF enum values in result dictionaries use the codes in the PDFium public headers. Embedded "
"scripts, XFA data and signature contents are returned for inspection."
msgstr ""
"每个读取器持有一份文档。页面、字符、附件、签名和对象路径均从 0 开始索引。几何数据使用原生 PDF 点坐标，Y 轴向上。像素坐标以完整渲染页面的左上角为原点。返回的 Godot 值在 "
"[method close] 之后仍可使用。\n"
"通过 [method get_capabilities] 查看可用能力。缺少对应能力时设为 [constant ERR_UNAVAILABLE]。文档中没有匹配内容时返回空结果并设为 "
"[constant OK]。用 [method get_last_error] 区分两种情况。缺少可选数据时可能省略对应字段。\n"
"返回字典中的 PDF 枚举值采用 PDFium 公开头文件中的代码。内嵌脚本、XFA 数据和签名内容供调用方检查。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Enables LCD text rendering."
msgstr "启用 LCD 文字渲染。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Forces halftone image scaling."
msgstr "强制使用半色调图像缩放。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Limits the PDFium image cache."
msgstr "限制 PDFium 图像缓存。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Matches letter case."
msgstr "匹配大小写。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Matches whole words."
msgstr "匹配完整单词。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Opens [param path] through [FileAccess]. Supply [param password] for an encrypted document. A "
"failed attempt preserves the open document. Returns [constant OK] on success."
msgstr "通过 [FileAccess] 打开 [param path]。加密文档需要提供 [param password]。打开失败时保留当前文档。成功时返回 [constant OK]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Opens a PDF from [param bytes] with an optional [param password]. The reader retains the bytes "
"until the document closes. A failed attempt preserves the open document. Returns [constant OK] on"
" success."
msgstr "从 [param bytes] 打开 PDF，可以传入 [param password]。读取器保留字节直到关闭文档。打开失败时保留当前文档。成功时返回 [constant OK]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Reads and renders PDF documents through PDFium."
msgstr "使用 PDFium 读取和渲染 PDF 文档。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Renders page content in grayscale."
msgstr "以灰度渲染页面内容。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Returns available PDFium capability identifiers. The identifiers are [code]core, document, "
"thumbnail, text, navigation, web_links, annotations, forms, attachments, signatures, structure, "
"page_objects, javascript, xfa[/code]."
msgstr ""
"返回可用的 PDFium 能力标识。标识包括 [code]core, document, thumbnail, text, navigation, web_links, annotations,"
" forms, attachments, signatures, structure, page_objects, javascript, xfa[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Returns the last operation's diagnostic message, or an empty string on success."
msgstr "返回上一次操作的错误说明。成功时返回空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the last operation's error on this instance. A successful query clears the error, "
"including a query that finds no content."
msgstr "返回此实例上一次操作的错误码。查询成功时清除错误，即使结果为空。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Returns whether the core PDFium library can be loaded."
msgstr "返回 PDFium 核心库是否可以加载。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Returns whether this reader holds an open document."
msgstr "返回此读取器是否已打开文档。"

#. doc_classes/PDFReader.xml
msgid "Uses PDFium's print rendering mode."
msgstr "使用 PDFium 的打印渲染模式。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"A writer holds one document and keeps edits in memory until saved. Page and list indices are "
"zero-based, except the ranges in [method import_page_range]. Geometry uses PDF points with the Y "
"axis increasing upward. Object, annotation and font IDs belong to the current writer. Saving and "
"changing the page order close all open edit pages and invalidate their IDs. Clipping, "
"transforming page content, or flattening closes the affected page. Changing an appearance stream "
"can invalidate its object IDs. Detached objects and fonts are released when the document closes. "
"PDFium supports detaching or removing direct children of a top-level Form. Detach a child before "
"editing its properties. Its transform is still relative to its previous Form, so adjust it before"
" placing the object on a page.\n"
"Capability identifiers are [code]document, save, pages, page_import, page_templates, "
"page_geometry, objects, paths, content_marks, fonts, text, images, annotations, "
"annotation_appearance, forms, flatten, attachments, catalog[/code]. A missing capability sets "
"[constant ERR_UNAVAILABLE]. Query [method get_last_error] and [method get_last_error_message] "
"after an operation fails. Mutations return [constant OK] on success unless otherwise documented. "
"New object, font, and annotation IDs are positive and return 0 on failure.\n"
"Full saves can invalidate existing signatures. Incremental saves retain the original bytes and "
"append an edited revision. Signature validity and permissions for a modified revision depend on "
"the original signature and must be checked separately. Form editing uses existing AcroForm "
"widgets."
msgstr ""
"每个写入器持有一份文档，编辑在保存前保留在内存中。页面和列表索引从零开始，[method import_page_range] 使用从一开始的范围。几何使用 PDF 点坐标，Y "
"轴向上。对象、注释和字体 ID 归当前写入器所有。保存和改变页面顺序会关闭所有打开的编辑页面，并使对应 ID 失效。裁剪、变换页面内容或压平会关闭受影响的页面。更改外观流可能使其对象 ID "
"失效。文档关闭时释放分离对象和字体。PDFium 支持分离或移除顶层 Form 的直接子对象。编辑属性前需先分离子对象。分离后其变换仍相对于原 Form，放入页面前请调整。\n"
"能力标识为 [code]document, save, pages, page_import, page_templates, page_geometry, objects, paths, "
"content_marks, fonts, text, images, annotations, annotation_appearance, forms, flatten, "
"attachments, catalog[/code]。能力缺失时设为 [constant ERR_UNAVAILABLE]。操作失败后可查询 [method get_last_error] 和"
" [method get_last_error_message]。除非另有说明，修改操作成功时返回 [constant OK]。新对象、字体和注释的 ID 为正数，失败时返回 0。\n"
"完整保存可能使现有签名失效。增量保存保留原始字节并追加编辑后的修订版。修改后的修订版是否符合签名及其权限取决于原签名，需要另行检查。表单编辑使用已有的 AcroForm 控件。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotation_appearance[/code]. Appends detached path, text, or image [param "
"object_id] to the appearance of [param annotation_id]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]annotation_appearance[/code]。将分离的路径、文本或图像对象 [param object_id] 追加到 [param annotation_id] "
"的外观。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotation_appearance[/code]. Removes and destroys appearance object [param "
"index] from [param annotation_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]annotation_appearance[/code]。移除并销毁 [param annotation_id] 中索引为 [param index] 的外观对象。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotation_appearance[/code]. Returns appearance object [param index] of [param "
"annotation_id]. PDFium supports Ink and Stamp appearance objects."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]annotation_appearance[/code]。返回 [param annotation_id] 中索引为 [param index] 的外观对象 ID。PDFium"
" 支持墨迹和图章外观对象。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotation_appearance[/code]. Returns the appearance object count of [param "
"annotation_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]annotation_appearance[/code]。返回 [param annotation_id] 的外观对象数量。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotation_appearance[/code]. Sets the PDF appearance stream of [param "
"annotation_id] in [param mode] using a string. Pass [code]null[/code] in [param appearance] to "
"clear it. Use [enum AppearanceMode] constants."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]annotation_appearance[/code]。用字符串设置 [param annotation_id] 在 [param mode] 下的 PDF 外观流。可在 "
"[param appearance] 传入 [code]null[/code] 清除外观。使用 [enum AppearanceMode] 常量。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotation_appearance[/code]. Sets the font [param color] of a FreeText [param "
"annotation_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]annotation_appearance[/code]。设置 FreeText 注释 [param annotation_id] 的字体颜色 [param color]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Adds an embedded file with [param name] and [param bytes] to"
" [param annotation_id]. An existing file attachment is replaced with the given bytes and retains "
"its name."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]annotations[/code]。将名为 [param name]、内容为 [param bytes] 的文件嵌入 [param "
"annotation_id]。已有附件时替换其字节并保留文件名。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Adds an ink stroke from [param points] to [param "
"annotation_id]. Returns its index or -1 on failure."
msgstr "能力 [code]annotations[/code]。向 [param annotation_id] 添加由 [param points] 构成的墨迹笔画。返回索引，失败时返回 -1。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Appends a quad of four [param points] to [param "
"annotation_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]annotations[/code]。向 [param annotation_id] 追加由四个 [param points] 构成的四边形。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Creates an annotation of [param subtype] on [param "
"page_index]. Use a code from [method get_supported_annotation_subtypes]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]annotations[/code]。在 [param page_index] 创建类型为 [param subtype] 的注释。使用 [method "
"get_supported_annotation_subtypes] 返回的代码。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Removes [param annotation_id] and invalidates its appearance"
" object IDs."
msgstr "能力 [code]annotations[/code]。移除 [param annotation_id]，并使其外观对象 ID 失效。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Removes the ink list of [param annotation_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]annotations[/code]。移除 [param annotation_id] 的墨迹列表。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Replaces attachment quad [param index] on [param "
"annotation_id] with four [param points] in PDFium order."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]annotations[/code]。用 PDFium 顺序的四个 [param points] 替换 [param annotation_id] 中索引为 [param "
"index] 的附着四边形。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Returns [enum AnnotationSubtype] codes that the active "
"backend supports for creation."
msgstr "能力 [code]annotations[/code]。返回当前后端支持创建的 [enum AnnotationSubtype] 代码。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Returns the ID of annotation [param annotation_index] on "
"[param page_index]."
msgstr "能力 [code]annotations[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 上索引为 [param annotation_index] 的注释 ID。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Sets [param color] on [param annotation_id]. Enable [param "
"interior] for the interior color. For an existing appearance stream, edit its objects instead."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]annotations[/code]。设置 [param annotation_id] 的颜色 [param color]。启用 [param interior] "
"可设置内部颜色。已有外观流时可编辑其中的对象。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Sets the PDF point [param rect] of [param annotation_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]annotations[/code]。设置 [param annotation_id] 的 PDF 点坐标矩形 [param rect]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Sets the [param radii] and [param width] of the border of "
"[param annotation_id] in points. PDFium may remove an existing appearance stream that overrides "
"the border."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]annotations[/code]。以点为单位设置 [param annotation_id] 的边框半径 [param radii] 和宽度 [param "
"width]。PDFium 可能移除覆盖边框设置的已有外观流。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Sets the annotation [param flags] of [param annotation_id]. "
"Use [enum AnnotationFlags] constants."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]annotations[/code]。设置 [param annotation_id] 的注释标志 [param flags]。使用 [enum "
"AnnotationFlags] 常量。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Sets the link action of [param annotation_id] to the ASCII "
"[param uri]."
msgstr "能力 [code]annotations[/code]。将 [param annotation_id] 的链接动作设为 ASCII [param uri]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]annotations[/code]. Writes [param value] to a string entry [param key] on [param"
" annotation_id]. Use the dedicated methods for typed PDF entries."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]annotations[/code]。将 [param value] 写入 [param annotation_id] 的字符串项 [param key]。有专用类型的 PDF"
" 项请使用对应方法。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]attachments[/code]. Adds a document attachment with [param name] and [param "
"bytes]. Returns its index or -1 on failure. Attachment indices can shift when entries change."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]attachments[/code]。添加名为 [param name]、内容为 [param bytes] 的文档附件。返回其索引，失败时返回 "
"-1。条目变化时附件索引可能移动。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]attachments[/code]. Deletes document attachment [param index]."
msgstr "能力 [code]attachments[/code]。删除文档附件 [param index]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]attachments[/code]. Replaces document attachment [param index] with [param "
"bytes]."
msgstr "能力 [code]attachments[/code]。用 [param bytes] 替换文档附件 [param index] 的内容。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]attachments[/code]. Sets a supported PDFium string property [param key] on "
"document attachment [param index] to [param value]."
msgstr "能力 [code]attachments[/code]。将文档附件 [param index] 上 PDFium 支持的字符串属性 [param key] 设为 [param value]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]attachments[/code]. Sets the [param description] of document attachment [param "
"index]."
msgstr "能力 [code]attachments[/code]。设置文档附件 [param index] 的描述 [param description]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]catalog[/code]. Copies the viewer preferences from the open [param reader]."
msgstr "能力 [code]catalog[/code]。从已打开的 [param reader] 复制查看器偏好。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]catalog[/code]. Sets the document catalog [param language], for example [code"
"]zh-Hans[/code]."
msgstr "能力 [code]catalog[/code]。设置文档目录语言 [param language]，例如 [code]zh-Hans[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]content_marks[/code]. Adds a content mark named [param name] to [param "
"object_id]. Returns its index or -1 on failure."
msgstr "能力 [code]content_marks[/code]。向 [param object_id] 添加名为 [param name] 的内容标记。返回标记索引，失败时返回 -1。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]content_marks[/code]. Adds the mark at [param mark_index] of [param "
"source_object_id] to [param object_id]. Consecutive objects can share one content mark in the "
"output."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]content_marks[/code]。将 [param source_object_id] 中 [param mark_index] 对应的标记添加到 [param "
"object_id]。输出中连续的对象可共用一个内容标记。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]content_marks[/code]. Removes [param key] from mark [param mark_index] of [param"
" object_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]content_marks[/code]。移除 [param object_id] 的标记 [param mark_index] 中的 [param key]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]content_marks[/code]. Removes [param mark_index] from [param object_id]. Later "
"mark indices can shift."
msgstr "能力 [code]content_marks[/code]。移除 [param object_id] 中索引为 [param mark_index] 的标记。后续标记索引可能移动。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]content_marks[/code]. Writes [param key] on mark [param mark_index] of [param "
"object_id]. [param value] accepts an integer, float, string, or byte array."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]content_marks[/code]。写入 [param object_id] 的标记 [param mark_index] 中的 [param key]。[param "
"value] 接受整数、浮点数、字符串或字节数组。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]document[/code]. Creates an empty PDF and makes it the current document on "
"success."
msgstr "能力 [code]document[/code]。创建空白 PDF，成功后将其设为当前文档。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]flatten[/code]. Flattens supported annotation and form appearances on [param "
"page_index] into page content. Use a [enum FlattenMode] constant for [param mode]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]flatten[/code]。将 [param page_index] 上受支持的注释和表单外观压平到页面内容。为 [param mode] 使用 [enum "
"FlattenMode] 常量。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]fonts[/code]. Loads a CID Type 2 font from [param data], a ToUnicode CMap [param"
" to_unicode], and the [param cid_to_gid] mapping bytes."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]fonts[/code]。从 [param data]、ToUnicode CMap [param to_unicode] 和映射字节 [param cid_to_gid] "
"加载 CID Type 2 字体。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]fonts[/code]. Loads a standard PDF font by [param name], such as "
"[code]Helvetica[/code]."
msgstr "能力 [code]fonts[/code]。按 [param name] 加载标准 PDF 字体，例如 [code]Helvetica[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]fonts[/code]. Loads font [param data] with [param type] from [enum FontType]. "
"Use [param cid] to create a composite CID font."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]fonts[/code]。按 [enum FontType] 中的 [param type] 加载字体 [param data]。使用 [param cid] 可创建复合 "
"CID 字体。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]fonts[/code]. Releases [param font_id]. Existing text objects retain their fonts."
msgstr "能力 [code]fonts[/code]。释放 [param font_id]。现有文本对象保留其字体。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]forms[/code]. Replaces the text of existing AcroForm field [param annotation_id]"
" with [param text], then commits the change."
msgstr "能力 [code]forms[/code]。将现有 AcroForm 字段 [param annotation_id] 的文本替换为 [param text]，并提交修改。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]forms[/code]. Selects the existing AcroForm radio widget [param annotation_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]forms[/code]。选中现有 AcroForm 单选控件 [param annotation_id]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]forms[/code]. Sets the field [param flags] of the AcroForm widget [param "
"annotation_id]. These are PDF field flags, independent of annotation flags."
msgstr "能力 [code]forms[/code]。设置 AcroForm 控件 [param annotation_id] 的字段标志 [param flags]。这些标志属于 PDF 表单字段。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]forms[/code]. Sets whether choice [param option_index] is [param selected] on "
"the AcroForm field [param annotation_id]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]forms[/code]。通过 [param selected] 设置 AcroForm 字段 [param annotation_id] 中的选项 [param "
"option_index] 是否选中。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]forms[/code]. Sets whether the existing AcroForm checkbox [param annotation_id] "
"is [param checked]."
msgstr "能力 [code]forms[/code]。通过 [param checked] 设置现有 AcroForm 复选框 [param annotation_id] 是否勾选。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]images[/code]. Creates a detached image object from JPEG [param bytes]."
msgstr "能力 [code]images[/code]。从 JPEG [param bytes] 创建分离的图像对象。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]images[/code]. Creates a detached image object from [param image]. Set its page "
"size and placement with [method set_object_matrix]."
msgstr "能力 [code]images[/code]。从 [param image] 创建分离的图像对象。用 [method set_object_matrix] 设置其页面大小和位置。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]images[/code]. Replaces [param object_id] pixels with [param image], preserving "
"its transform. The RGBA8 bitmap is limited to 8192 pixels per edge and 64 MiB."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]images[/code]。用 [param image] 替换 [param object_id] 的像素并保留变换。RGBA8 位图单边最多 8192 像素，大小上限为 "
"64 MiB。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]images[/code]. Replaces [param object_id] with inline JPEG [param bytes], "
"preserving its transform."
msgstr "能力 [code]images[/code]。用内联 JPEG [param bytes] 替换 [param object_id]，并保留变换。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]objects[/code]. Applies [param transform] to [param object_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。对 [param object_id] 应用 [param transform]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]objects[/code]. Applies [param transform] to the clip path of [param object_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。对 [param object_id] 的裁剪路径应用 [param transform]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]objects[/code]. Detaches [param object_id] from its page or parent Form. The "
"object ID can be inserted again. Reacquire any descendant IDs. For a deeply nested object, detach"
" the containing Form first."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]objects[/code]。从页面或父 Form 对象分离 [param object_id]。可用该 ID 重新插入对象。后代对象的 ID "
"需重新获取。对于多层嵌套的对象，先分离其所属的 Form。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]objects[/code]. Generates the PDF content stream for [param page_index]. Saving "
"also generates dirty pages automatically."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。生成 [param page_index] 的 PDF 内容流。保存时也会自动生成已修改页面的内容流。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]objects[/code]. Inserts detached [param object_id] into [param page_index] at "
"[param at]. Pass -1 to append."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。将分离对象 [param object_id] 插入 [param page_index] 的 [param at]。传入 -1 可追加。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]objects[/code]. Removes and destroys [param object_id], including a detached "
"object. Use [method remove_annotation_object] for an annotation appearance object."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]objects[/code]。移除并销毁 [param object_id]，包括已分离的对象。注释外观对象使用 [method "
"remove_annotation_object]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]objects[/code]. Replaces the matrix of [param object_id] with [param transform]."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。将 [param object_id] 的矩阵替换为 [param transform]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]objects[/code]. Returns child [param index] of the Form object [param object_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。返回 Form 对象 [param object_id] 中索引为 [param index] 的子对象 ID。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]objects[/code]. Returns the child count of the Form object [param object_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。返回 Form 对象 [param object_id] 的子对象数量。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]objects[/code]. Returns the object ID at [param object_path] on [param "
"page_index]. Path components are zero-based indices into the page and nested Form objects."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]objects[/code]。返回 [param page_index] 上 [param object_path] 对应的对象 ID。路径分量是页面和嵌套 Form 对象中从"
" 0 开始的索引。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]objects[/code]. Sets [param object_id] blend mode to the PDF name [param mode], "
"such as [code]Multiply[/code]."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。将 [param object_id] 的混合模式设置为 PDF 名称 [param mode]，例如 [code]Multiply[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]objects[/code]. Sets dash [param lengths] and [param phase] in points on [param "
"object_id]. An empty array makes a solid stroke."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。设置 [param object_id] 的虚线长度 [param lengths] 和相位 [param phase]，单位为点。空数组表示实线。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]objects[/code]. Sets the fill [param color] of [param object_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。设置 [param object_id] 的填充颜色 [param color]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]objects[/code]. Sets the line [param cap] of [param object_id]. Use a [enum "
"LineCap] constant."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。设置 [param object_id] 的线端 [param cap]。使用 [enum LineCap] 常量。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]objects[/code]. Sets the line [param join] of [param object_id]. Use a [enum "
"LineJoin] constant."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。设置 [param object_id] 的线连接 [param join]。使用 [enum LineJoin] 常量。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]objects[/code]. Sets the stroke [param color] of [param object_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。设置 [param object_id] 的描边颜色 [param color]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]objects[/code]. Sets the stroke [param width] of [param object_id] in points."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。设置 [param object_id] 的描边宽度 [param width]，单位为点。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]objects[/code]. Sets whether [param object_id] is included when [param active] "
"is true."
msgstr "能力 [code]objects[/code]。通过 [param active] 设置是否包含 [param object_id]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]page_geometry[/code]. Applies [param transform] to all annotations on [param "
"page_index]."
msgstr "能力 [code]page_geometry[/code]。对 [param page_index] 上的所有注释应用 [param transform]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]page_geometry[/code]. Clips [param page_index] to [param rect]."
msgstr "能力 [code]page_geometry[/code]。将 [param page_index] 裁剪到 [param rect]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]page_geometry[/code]. Sets [param box] of [param page_index] to [param rect]. "
"Use a [enum PageBox] constant."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]page_geometry[/code]。将 [param page_index] 的 [param box] 设置为 [param rect]。使用 [enum "
"PageBox] 常量。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]page_geometry[/code]. Sets [param page_index] rotation to [param degrees] "
"clockwise. Accepts 0, 90, 180, and 270."
msgstr "能力 [code]page_geometry[/code]。将 [param page_index] 设为顺时针旋转 [param degrees] 度。可用值为 0、90、180 和 270。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]page_geometry[/code]. Transforms the contents of [param page_index] with [param "
"transform]. Pass a [Rect2] in [param clip] to also clip the page."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]page_geometry[/code]。用 [param transform] 变换 [param page_index] 的内容。可向 [param clip] 传入 "
"[Rect2] 以裁剪页面。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]page_import[/code]. Copies pages from [param reader] at [param at]. [param "
"range] uses the one-based PDFium syntax, for example [code]1,3,5-7[/code]. An empty string "
"selects all pages. Pass -1 to append."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]page_import[/code]。在 [param at] 从 [param reader] 复制页面。[param range] 使用从 1 开始的 PDFium "
"范围语法，例如 [code]1,3,5-7[/code]。空字符串选择全部页面。传入 -1 可追加。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]page_import[/code]. Copies pages from [param reader] in the order of [param "
"indices]. An empty array selects all pages. Pass -1 for [param at] to append."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]page_import[/code]。从 [param reader] 按 [param indices] 顺序复制页面。空数组选择全部页面。[param at] 传入 -1 "
"可追加。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]page_templates[/code]. Creates a detached vector Form object from [param "
"page_index] in [param reader]. Call again to place multiple copies."
msgstr "能力 [code]page_templates[/code]。从 [param reader] 的 [param page_index] 创建分离的矢量 Form 对象。再次调用可放置多个副本。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]page_templates[/code]. Creates a new document by arranging pages from [param "
"reader] in a grid of [param columns] by [param rows] on pages of [param size_pt] points. Replaces"
" the current document on success."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]page_templates[/code]。将 [param reader] 的页面按 [param columns] 列、[param rows] 行排列在大小为 "
"[param size_pt] 点的页面上。成功后替换当前文档。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]pages[/code]. Deletes the page at [param page_index]."
msgstr "能力 [code]pages[/code]。删除 [param page_index] 对应的页面。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]pages[/code]. Inserts a page of [param size_pt] points at [param at] and returns"
" its index. Pass -1 to append. Returns -1 on failure."
msgstr "能力 [code]pages[/code]。在 [param at] 插入大小为 [param size_pt] 点的页面，返回其索引。传入 -1 可追加。失败时返回 -1。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]pages[/code]. Moves [param indices] in the given order to position [param at] in"
" the remaining pages. Duplicate indices are invalid."
msgstr "能力 [code]pages[/code]。按给定顺序将 [param indices] 移动到剩余页面中的 [param at]。索引不得重复。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]paths[/code]. Adds a cubic Bézier segment to [param object_id] with controls "
"[param control_a] and [param control_b], ending at [param end]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]paths[/code]。向 [param object_id] 添加三次 Bézier 线段，控制点为 [param control_a] 和 [param "
"control_b]，终点为 [param end]。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]paths[/code]. Adds a line to [param point] in [param object_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]paths[/code]。在 [param object_id] 中添加到 [param point] 的直线。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]paths[/code]. Closes the current subpath in [param object_id]."
msgstr "能力 [code]paths[/code]。闭合 [param object_id] 的当前子路径。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]paths[/code]. Creates a detached path beginning at [param start]."
msgstr "能力 [code]paths[/code]。创建从 [param start] 开始的分离路径。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]paths[/code]. Creates a detached rectangular path with bounds [param rect]."
msgstr "能力 [code]paths[/code]。创建范围为 [param rect] 的分离矩形路径。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]paths[/code]. Sets [param object_id] to [param fill_mode] and enables its stroke"
" with [param stroke]. Use a [enum FillMode] constant."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]paths[/code]。为 [param object_id] 设置 [param fill_mode]，并用 [param stroke] 启用描边。使用 [enum "
"FillMode] 常量。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]paths[/code]. Starts a new subpath in [param object_id] at [param point]."
msgstr "能力 [code]paths[/code]。在 [param object_id] 的 [param point] 开始新的子路径。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]save[/code]. Saves the current document to a byte array. Use [enum SaveFlags] "
"for [param flags]. [param version] is zero for the SDK default or 10 through 17 for PDF 1.0 "
"through 1.7. Returns an empty array on failure."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]save[/code]。将当前文档保存为字节数组。[param flags] 使用 [enum SaveFlags]。[param version] 为零时使用 SDK "
"默认值，10 至 17 对应 PDF 1.0 至 1.7。失败时返回空数组。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]save[/code]. Saves to [param path], replacing the destination after a successful"
" write. Use [param flags] and [param version] as in [method save_to_buffer]. The writer remains "
"open for further edits."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]save[/code]。保存到 [param path]，写入成功后替换目标文件。[param flags] 和 [param version] 与 [method "
"save_to_buffer] 相同。写入器保持打开，可以继续编辑。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]text[/code]. Creates a detached text object using [param font_id], [param "
"font_size] in points, and [param text]. The caller can set the text position with [method "
"set_object_matrix]."
msgstr ""
"能力 [code]text[/code]。用 [param font_id]、以点为单位的 [param font_size] 和 [param text] 创建分离的文本对象。可通过 "
"[method set_object_matrix] 设置文本位置。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]text[/code]. Replaces [param object_id] text using font-specific unsigned 32-bit"
" [param charcodes]."
msgstr "能力 [code]text[/code]。用字体对应的无符号 32 位 [param charcodes] 替换 [param object_id] 的文本。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]text[/code]. Replaces the text in [param object_id] with [param text]. PDFium "
"requires a non-empty string."
msgstr "能力 [code]text[/code]。将 [param object_id] 的文本替换为 [param text]。PDFium 要求非空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Capability [code]text[/code]. Sets [param object_id] font [param size] in points."
msgstr "能力 [code]text[/code]。设置 [param object_id] 的字体大小 [param size]，单位为点。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]text[/code]. Sets relative [param positions] in points for the characters of "
"[param object_id], excluding the first character at position zero."
msgstr "能力 [code]text[/code]。以点为单位设置 [param object_id] 中文字的相对 [param positions]，首字符固定在零位置。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Capability [code]text[/code]. Sets the text render [param mode] of [param object_id]. Use a [enum"
" TextRenderMode] constant."
msgstr "能力 [code]text[/code]。设置 [param object_id] 的文本渲染模式 [param mode]。使用 [enum TextRenderMode] 常量。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Closes the document and discards unsaved edits. May be called repeatedly."
msgstr "关闭文档并丢弃未保存的编辑。可重复调用。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Creates and edits PDF documents through PDFium."
msgstr "使用 PDFium 创建和编辑 PDF 文档。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Opens [param bytes] with the optional [param password]. The writer retains the input until the "
"document closes."
msgstr "使用可选的 [param password] 打开 [param bytes]。写入器保留输入字节直到文档关闭。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Opens [param path] with the optional [param password]. A failed open preserves the current "
"document."
msgstr "使用可选的 [param password] 打开 [param path]。失败时保留当前文档。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Removes existing encryption during a full save."
msgstr "完整保存时移除已有加密。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Requests PDFium font subsetting for newly added text."
msgstr "请求 PDFium 为新添加的文字生成字体子集。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Returns the available writer capability groups. See the class description for their identifiers."
msgstr "返回可用的写入能力组。标识见类说明。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Returns the last operation's diagnostic message."
msgstr "返回上一次操作的错误说明。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Returns the last operation's error on this instance."
msgstr "返回此实例上一次操作的错误码。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Returns the page count of the current document."
msgstr "返回当前文档的页数。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Returns whether a document is open."
msgstr "返回是否已打开文档。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Returns whether the PDFium backend can create, open, and save a document."
msgstr "返回 PDFium 后端是否可以创建、打开和保存文档。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid ""
"Writes a copy with the original input bytes followed by the changes. Requires an opened PDF, the "
"default version and unchanged encryption."
msgstr "写入原始输入字节，再追加修改。需要已打开的 PDF、默认版本及原有加密。"

#. doc_classes/PDFWriter.xml
msgid "Writes a full PDF copy and preserves existing encryption."
msgstr "写入完整 PDF 副本并保留已有加密。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Draws the current layout during [method CanvasItem._draw]. Both the top-left drawing position and"
" the optional axis-aligned clip rectangle are in the canvas item's local coordinates. The default"
" clip applies only the document's clipping rules. Before a successful layout, this method draws "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"在 [method CanvasItem._draw] "
"中绘制当前布局。绘制起点为左上角，与可选的轴对齐裁剪矩形均使用画布项的局部坐标。默认裁剪仅应用文档的裁剪规则。首次成功布局前，此方法不绘制内容。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid "Parses and lays out HTML for drawing on a [CanvasItem]."
msgstr "解析并排版 HTML，以便在 [CanvasItem] 上绘制。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid "Releases the document, layout, and drawing resources, and clears the last error."
msgstr "释放文档、布局及绘制资源，并清除上次错误。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces the document and resets its layout. An empty string creates an empty document. Styles "
"come from inline attributes, [code]<style>[/code] elements, [code]<link rel=\"stylesheet\">[/code], "
"and the optional stylesheet text. Use [code]@import[/code] to include UTF-8 [code].css[/code] files "
"within the project. Relative URLs in a CSS file are resolved from that file's directory. Relative "
"URLs in HTML and stylesheet text are resolved from [param base_dir]. Paths may use [code]../[/code] "
"within the project or absolute [code]res://[/code] paths. Images can be imported PNG, JPEG, WebP, or SVG textures. Missing or unsupported assets are skipped. "
"Returns [constant OK] on success, [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] for a base directory outside "
"[code]res://[/code], or [constant ERR_PARSE_ERROR] if the document cannot be parsed."
msgstr ""
"替换文档并重置布局。空字符串会创建空文档。样式来自内联属性、[code]<style>[/code] 元素、"
"[code]<link rel=\"stylesheet\">[/code] 和可选的样式表文本。可用 [code]@import[/code] 加载项目内 UTF-8 编码的 "
"[code].css[/code] 文件。CSS 文件中的相对 URL 以文件所在目录为基准。HTML 和传入的样式表文本中的相对 URL 以 "
"[param base_dir] 为基准。路径可使用 [code]../[/code] 访问项目内的上级目录，也可使用绝对 [code]res://[/code] 路径。"
"图片可使用已导入的 PNG、JPEG、WebP 或 SVG 纹理。缺失或不受支持的资源会被跳过。成功时返回 [constant OK]，基目录不在 "
"[code]res://[/code] 中时返回 [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]，无法解析文档时返回 [constant ERR_PARSE_ERROR]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the content size in pixels from the most recent successful layout of the current "
"document. Returns [constant Vector2i.ZERO] before layout and for an empty document."
msgstr "返回当前文档最近一次成功布局的内容尺寸，单位为像素。布局前或文档为空时返回 [constant Vector2i.ZERO]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the diagnostic message from the last failed parse or layout. A successful parse or layout"
" clears the message."
msgstr "返回最近一次解析或布局失败的诊断消息。成功解析或布局后清除该消息。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the original [code]href[/code] of the link at a point in document coordinates, or an "
"empty string. Subtract the drawing position from the canvas-local point and apply any caller-"
"supplied clip before querying. The caller handles navigation."
msgstr "返回文档坐标中指定点命中的链接的原始 [code]href[/code]，没有链接时返回空字符串。查询前，从画布局部坐标中减去绘制起点，并检查调用方指定的裁剪区域。导航由调用方处理。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Updates media queries and lays out the current document using the viewport width and height in "
"pixels. Returns [constant OK] on success, [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] for nonpositive "
"dimensions, [constant ERR_UNCONFIGURED] before a successful parse, or [constant ERR_INVALID_DATA] "
"if the layout cannot be represented."
msgstr ""
"更新媒体查询并按视口的像素宽高布局当前文档。成功时返回 [constant OK]，尺寸非正数时返回 [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]，尚未成功解析时返回 "
"[constant ERR_UNCONFIGURED]，布局结果无法表示时返回 [constant ERR_INVALID_DATA]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Use [method parse] to load an HTML document or fragment and [method layout] to set its viewport "
"size. Call [method draw] from the target [CanvasItem]'s [method CanvasItem._draw] callback. Call "
"[method CanvasItem.queue_redraw] after changing the document, viewport size, or drawing position."
"\n"
"Supports block and inline layout, lists, tables, text, backgrounds, and local images. Borders support "
"[code]solid[/code], [code]dashed[/code], [code]dotted[/code], and [code]double[/code], with separate styles, widths, and colors per side. "
"[code]border-radius[/code] rounds backgrounds, borders, and images, and clips overflowing children when "
"[code]overflow: hidden[/code] is set. Backgrounds support [code]linear-gradient()[/code], "
"[code]radial-gradient()[/code], and [code]conic-gradient()[/code] with sRGB color interpolation.\n"
"Text uses the project theme's default font or Godot's fallback font. Run the renderer on the main thread.\n"
"[code]box-shadow[/code] supports offsets, blur, spread, and comma-separated layers. Use [code]inset[/code] "
"for an inner shadow. Shadows follow [code]border-radius[/code] and leave layout and scroll ranges unaffected."
msgstr ""
"使用 [method parse] 加载 HTML 文档或片段，再用 [method layout] 设置视口尺寸。在目标 [CanvasItem] 的 [method "
"CanvasItem._draw] 回调中调用 [method draw]。文档、视口尺寸或绘制位置发生变化后，调用 [method CanvasItem.queue_redraw]。\n"
"支持块布局和行内布局、列表、表格、文字、背景和本地图片。边框支持实线 [code]solid[/code]、虚线 [code]dashed[/code]、"
"点线 [code]dotted[/code] 和双线 [code]double[/code]，各边可以分别设置样式、宽度和颜色。[code]border-radius[/code] 可为背景、边框和图片添加圆角，"
"设置 [code]overflow: hidden[/code] 时也会裁剪溢出的子内容。背景支持 [code]linear-gradient()[/code]、"
"[code]radial-gradient()[/code] 和 [code]conic-gradient()[/code]，使用 sRGB 颜色插值。\n"
"文字使用项目主题的默认字体或 Godot 的回退字体。请在主线程中使用渲染器。\n"
"[code]box-shadow[/code] 支持偏移、模糊、扩张距离以及逗号分隔的多层阴影。使用 [code]inset[/code] 绘制内阴影。"
"阴影沿 [code]border-radius[/code] 绘制，布局和滚动范围维持原样。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Returns the attribute value, or [param default_value] if the attribute is absent. Attribute names are ASCII case-insensitive. An explicitly empty attribute returns an empty string."
msgstr "返回属性值。属性不存在时返回 [param default_value]。属性名称的 ASCII 字母不区分大小写。显式指定的空属性返回空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Returns the union of the rectangles from [method get_client_rects], or an empty rectangle if there are no boxes."
msgstr "返回包含 [method get_client_rects] 所有矩形的最小矩形。没有布局盒时返回空矩形。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Returns the direct child elements in document order. Text nodes, comments, and CSS-generated pseudo-elements are excluded."
msgstr "按文档顺序返回直接子元素，跳过文本节点、注释和 CSS 生成的伪元素。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Returns the element's border-box fragments in document pixel coordinates, before clipping or label scrolling. An inline element may have multiple rectangles. The array is empty before layout or when the element has no layout box."
msgstr "以文档像素坐标返回元素各片段的边框盒，坐标与裁剪和控件滚动无关。行内元素可能有多个矩形。排版前或元素没有布局盒时返回空数组。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Returns the parent element, or [code]null[/code] if this element has no parent."
msgstr "返回父元素。没有父元素时返回 [code]null[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Returns the element's lowercase HTML tag name."
msgstr "返回元素的小写 HTML 标签名。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Concatenates the parsed text nodes in document order, including hidden content. Comments and CSS-generated text are excluded. For the laid-out text of the document, see [method HTMLLayout.get_plain_text]."
msgstr "按文档顺序连接解析后的文本节点，包含隐藏内容，跳过注释和 CSS 生成的文本。获取排版后的文档文本请参见 [method HTMLLayout.get_plain_text]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Returns whether the element has an attribute with the given name, including an empty attribute."
msgstr "返回元素是否具有指定名称的属性，空属性也视为存在。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Returns whether the handle still refers to an element in its original parsed layout."
msgstr "返回句柄是否仍指向原始解析布局中的元素。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid "Returns the frontmost element at the given document pixel position, accounting for overflow clipping. Returns [code]null[/code] when there is no hit or no layout."
msgstr "返回指定文档像素位置处最上层的元素，并考虑溢出裁剪。未命中或尚未排版时返回 [code]null[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid "Returns the first element with the given case-sensitive HTML ID, including hidden elements. Pass the ID without [code]#[/code]. Returns [code]null[/code] if the ID is absent."
msgstr "返回第一个匹配指定 HTML ID 的元素，包括隐藏元素。ID 区分大小写，传入时省略 [code]#[/code]。ID 不存在时返回 [code]null[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid "Returns the first match in document order, or [code]null[/code]. See [method query_selector_all] for selector syntax."
msgstr "按文档顺序返回第一个匹配项。无匹配时返回 [code]null[/code]。选择器语法见 [method query_selector_all]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid "Returns matching elements from the litehtml element tree in document order, with each element included once. Tags, classes, IDs, attributes, combinators, and comma-separated lists are supported. Queries include hidden elements and are available after parsing. Invalid or unsupported selectors report an error and return an empty array."
msgstr "按文档顺序返回 litehtml 元素树中匹配的元素，每个元素只出现一次。支持标签、类、ID、属性、组合器和逗号分隔的列表。解析后即可查询，结果包含隐藏元素。选择器无效或不受支持时会报告错误并返回空数组。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid "Returns the element at the given position in this control's local coordinates. The scroll offset is applied automatically. Returns [code]null[/code] outside the content viewport, including the scrollbars, and when there is no hit or the layout is pending."
msgstr "返回控件局部坐标中指定位置处的元素，并自动应用滚动偏移。位置在内容视口之外（含滚动条区域）、未命中或布局待更新时返回 [code]null[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid "Looks up a case-sensitive HTML ID in this label's parsed document. See [method HTMLLayout.get_element_by_id]."
msgstr "在控件解析后的文档中查找区分大小写的 HTML ID。参见 [method HTMLLayout.get_element_by_id]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid "Returns the first match in this label's parsed document. See [method HTMLLayout.query_selector]."
msgstr "返回控件解析后的文档中的第一个匹配项。参见 [method HTMLLayout.query_selector]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid "Returns all matches in this label's parsed document. See [method HTMLLayout.query_selector_all]."
msgstr "返回控件解析后的文档中的全部匹配项。参见 [method HTMLLayout.query_selector_all]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid "Scrolls to an element obtained from this label. [param align] positions the element's top from [code]0.0[/code] at the viewport top to [code]1.0[/code] at the viewport bottom, within the scrollable range. Horizontal scrolling adjusts when the target's left edge is outside the viewport. Returns [code]false[/code] for an invalid, foreign, or invisible element, or when layout is pending."
msgstr "滚动到从此控件获取的元素。[param align] 将元素顶部定位于视口顶部的 [code]0.0[/code] 到视口底部的 [code]1.0[/code] 之间，实际偏移限制在可滚动范围内。目标左边缘在视口之外时会调整横向偏移。元素无效、属于其他布局、不可见或布局待更新时返回 [code]false[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid "Displays a scrollable HTML document."
msgstr "显示可滚动的 HTML 文档。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the left mouse button is pressed and released over the same visible link without "
"dragging or scrolling. [param uri] is the link's original [code]href[/code]."
msgstr "左键在同一可见链接上按下和松开，且期间没有拖动或滚动时发出。[param uri] 为链接原始的 [code]href[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid "Returns the horizontal and vertical scroll offset in pixels from the start of the document."
msgstr "返回相对于文档起点的水平和垂直滚动偏移，单位为像素。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the laid-out document size in pixels. Returns [constant Vector2i.ZERO] when there is no "
"valid layout or the document is empty."
msgstr "返回排版后的文档尺寸，单位为像素。布局无效或文档为空时返回 [constant Vector2i.ZERO]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the latest parsing or layout error, or an empty string on success. Errors are also shown "
"in the editor as node configuration warnings."
msgstr "返回最近一次解析或布局错误，成功时返回空字符串。编辑器也会以节点配置警告显示错误。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the horizontal and vertical scroll offset in pixels, clamped to the scrollable range. If a "
"layout is pending, the offset is applied after that layout."
msgstr "设置水平和垂直滚动偏移，单位为像素，取值限制在可滚动范围内。如果正在等待布局，则在该次布局后应用偏移。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid "The HTML document or fragment to display."
msgstr "要显示的 HTML 文档或片段。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLDocument.xml
msgid "A shareable source document for static HTML."
msgstr "可共享的静态 HTML 源文档。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Additional CSS for [member text], passed to [method HTMLLayout.parse] alongside inline styles and"
" [code]<style>[/code] elements."
msgstr "[member text] 的附加 CSS，与内联样式和 [code]<style>[/code] 元素一起传给 [method HTMLLayout.parse]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLDocument.xml
msgid "Additional CSS for this document."
msgstr "此文档的附加 CSS。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Displays [member document] or inline [member text] using [HTMLLayout]. Give the control a size "
"with anchors, offsets, or a parent [Container]. The document wraps to the available width, and "
"scrollbars appear as needed to reach overflowing content.\n"
"Source changes are applied on a deferred update and reset the scroll position. Resizing "
"recalculates the layout and clamps the current scroll offset. Clicking a [code]#id[/code] link "
"scrolls to the matching HTML element. Connect [signal link_pressed] to handle other links.\n"
"Drag to select rendered text. The focused control supports the standard select-all and copy "
"shortcuts. The theme color [code]selection_color[/code] sets the selection highlight.\n"
"CSS [code]:hover[/code] matches the element under the mouse and its ancestors. Scrolling updates "
"the hovered element even when the mouse is stationary. During text selection by dragging, hover "
"styles stay fixed until the drag ends.\n"
"CSS [code]cursor[/code] supports [code]default[/code], [code]pointer[/code], [code]text[/code], "
"[code]crosshair[/code], [code]move[/code], [code]wait[/code], [code]progress[/code], "
"[code]help[/code], [code]not-allowed[/code], [code]ew-resize[/code], and [code]ns-resize[/code]. "
"With [code]auto[/code] or unsupported values, the control uses a pointing hand over links, an "
"I-beam when text selection is enabled, and an arrow otherwise. Dragging to select text uses the "
"I-beam."
msgstr ""
"使用 [HTMLLayout] 显示 [member document] 或内联的 [member text]。通过锚点、偏移或父级 [Container] "
"为控件分配尺寸。文档按可用宽度换行，滚动条按需出现，以便查看溢出的内容。\n"
"源内容变更会延迟应用并重置滚动位置。调整尺寸会重新布局，并将当前滚动偏移限制在可滚动范围内。"
"点击 [code]#id[/code] 链接会滚动到对应的 HTML 元素。连接 [signal link_pressed] 可处理其他链接。\n"
"拖动鼠标可选中渲染后的文字。控件获得焦点时支持标准的全选和复制快捷键。主题颜色 [code]selection_color[/code] 控制选区高亮。\n"
"CSS [code]:hover[/code] 匹配鼠标下的元素及其祖先。鼠标静止时滚动也会更新悬停目标。拖选文字时保持当前悬停样式，直到拖选结束。\n"
"CSS [code]cursor[/code] 支持 [code]default[/code]、[code]pointer[/code]、[code]text[/code]、"
"[code]crosshair[/code]、[code]move[/code]、[code]wait[/code]、[code]progress[/code]、"
"[code]help[/code]、[code]not-allowed[/code]、[code]ew-resize[/code] 和 [code]ns-resize[/code]。"
"使用 [code]auto[/code] 或未支持的值时，链接上显示手形，启用文字选择时显示工字形，其余情况显示箭头。拖选文字时显示工字形。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid "Clears the text selection."
msgstr "清除文本选区。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid "Returns the selected plain text, or an empty string if nothing is selected."
msgstr "返回选中的纯文本。没有选区时返回空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid "Enables text selection. Disabling it clears the current selection."
msgstr "启用文本选择。关闭时清除当前选区。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the laid-out text in document order. Block boundaries and explicit line breaks are "
"represented by newlines, and table cells are separated by tabs. Soft wrapping does not add "
"newlines. Returns an empty string before layout."
msgstr "按文档顺序返回排版后的文本。块边界和显式换行以换行符表示，表格单元格以制表符分隔。自动折行不会添加换行符。排版前返回空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Returns highlight rectangles in document coordinates for the character range from [param from] "
"up to [param to]. Offsets refer to [method get_plain_text] and are clamped to its length. "
"Rectangles are clipped to the HTML layout's visible regions."
msgstr "返回从 [param from] 到 [param to]（不含）的字符范围在文档坐标中的高亮矩形。偏移量基于 [method get_plain_text]，并限制在文本长度内。矩形按 HTML 排版的可见区域裁剪。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the nearest caret offset in [method get_plain_text] for a point in document coordinates. "
"Returns [code]0[/code] when there is no text."
msgstr "返回文档坐标中指定点在 [method get_plain_text] 内对应的最近光标偏移量。没有文本时返回 [code]0[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/MarkdownLabel.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], renders raw HTML blocks using [HTMLLayout], including blocks inside quotes "
"and list items. Supports inline bold, italic, strikethrough, code, highlights, line breaks, "
"links, and [code]span[/code] styles for text color and background color. Selection, copying, and "
"search include rendered HTML text alongside Markdown text. Clicking a link in HTML emits [signal "
"link_pressed]. The editor's Markdown preview enables this property.\n"
"HTML blocks use the theme's [code]text_font[/code], [code]text_font_color[/code], "
"[code]text_font_size[/code] (including [member extra_font_size]), and [code]link_color[/code] as "
"defaults. The theme's [code]bold_font[/code], [code]italic_font[/code], "
"[code]bold_italic_font[/code], [code]code_text_font[/code], and [code]code_block_font[/code] are "
"used for matching text styles when configured. CSS still controls the text style.\n"
"A linked stylesheet applies to the HTML block that includes it. Put the link and its styled elements in the same block. "
"When exporting raw Markdown that links to stylesheets, include the local [code].css[/code] files in the export preset.\n"
"Inline [code]<img>[/code] uses the same project image paths and formats as [HTMLLayout]. It "
"supports [code]src[/code], [code]alt[/code], [code]title[/code], and positive integer "
"[code]width[/code] and [code]height[/code] in pixels. With a single dimension, the image keeps "
"its aspect ratio."
msgstr ""
"为 [code]true[/code] 时，使用 [HTMLLayout] 渲染原始 HTML 块，包括引用和列表项内的 HTML 块。支持行内粗体、斜体、删除线、代码、高亮、换行、链接和 "
"[code]span[/code] 的文字颜色及背景色样式。渲染后的 HTML 文字和 Markdown 文字都支持选择、复制和搜索。点击 HTML 链接会发出 [signal "
"link_pressed]。编辑器的 Markdown 预览会开启此属性。\n"
"HTML 块默认使用主题的 [code]text_font[/code]、[code]text_font_color[/code]、[code]text_font_size[/code]（含 [member "
"extra_font_size]）和 [code]link_color[/code]。配置 [code]bold_font[/code]、[code]italic_font[/code]、"
"[code]bold_italic_font[/code]、[code]code_text_font[/code] 和 [code]code_block_font[/code] 后，对应的文字样式会使用这些字体。"
"文字样式仍由 CSS 控制。\n"
"链接的样式表作用于包含它的 HTML 块。请将链接和应用样式的元素放在同一个块中。"
"导出引用外部样式表的原始 Markdown 文件时，将本地 [code].css[/code] 文件加入导出预设。\n"
"行内 [code]<img>[/code] 与 [HTMLLayout] 支持相同的项目图片路径和格式。支持 "
"[code]src[/code]、[code]alt[/code]、[code]title[/code]，以及以像素为单位的正整数 [code]width[/code] 和 "
"[code]height[/code]。只指定一个尺寸时，图片会保持宽高比。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Load an imported [code].html[/code] or [code].htm[/code] file, or create an [HTMLDocument] and "
"set its [member text]. Assign the resource to [member HTMLLabel.document] for automatic display. "
"Use [method create_layout] when drawing directly.\n"
"Scripts that previously called [code]HTMLDocument.new().parse(html)[/code] should call "
"[code]HTMLLayout.new().parse(html)[/code]. Each [HTMLLayout] keeps its own parsed document, "
"viewport, and drawing state.\n"
"The HTML importer embeds linked and imported CSS and records their textures as resource dependencies for export. Reimport the HTML file after changing a linked stylesheet.\n"
"Imported documents include local image dependencies from all media query branches. In a "
"selected-scenes export preset, add [code]addons/docrender/docrender.gdextension[/code] to the "
"include filter so the exported project can load DocRender classes."
msgstr ""
"加载已导入的 [code].html[/code] 或 [code].htm[/code] 文件，也可以创建 [HTMLDocument] 并设置其 [member text]。将资源赋给 "
"[member HTMLLabel.document] 即可自动显示。直接绘制时使用 [method create_layout]。\n"
"原来调用 [code]HTMLDocument.new().parse(html)[/code] 的脚本请改用 "
"[code]HTMLLayout.new().parse(html)[/code]。每个 [HTMLLayout] 独立持有解析结果、视口和绘制状态。\n"
"HTML 导入器会嵌入链接及导入的 CSS，并将其中引用的纹理保存为导出依赖。修改外部样式表后，请重新导入 HTML 文件。\n"
"导入的文档包含所有媒体查询分支的本地图片依赖。在仅导出选定场景的预设中，将 "
"[code]addons/docrender/docrender.gdextension[/code] 加入包含筛选器，使导出的项目可以加载 DocRender 的类。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Parses a snapshot of this resource into a new [HTMLLayout]. Call [method HTMLLayout.layout] with "
"the target viewport size, then [method HTMLLayout.draw] to display it. See [method "
"HTMLLayout.get_render_error] for parse or layout errors."
msgstr ""
"将此资源的快照解析为新的 [HTMLLayout]。使用目标视口尺寸调用 [method HTMLLayout.layout]，再用 [method HTMLLayout.draw] "
"显示。解析或布局错误见 [method HTMLLayout.get_render_error]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Project resource directory used to resolve relative image paths for [member text]. See [method "
"HTMLLayout.parse] for the supported paths and image formats."
msgstr "用于解析 [member text] 相对图片路径的项目资源目录。支持的路径和图片格式见 [method HTMLLayout.parse]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid ""
"The HTML resource to display. Its source and styles take priority over the local properties. Set "
"this to [code]null[/code] to use [member text], [member base_dir], and [member stylesheet]."
msgstr ""
"要显示的 HTML 资源。资源的源内容和样式优先于本地属性。设为 [code]null[/code] 时使用 [member text]、[member base_dir] 和 [member "
"stylesheet]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLDocument.xml
msgid ""
"The project directory used for relative image paths. Imported resources use the source file's "
"directory."
msgstr "用于解析相对图片路径的项目目录。导入的资源使用原始文件所在目录。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLDocument.xml
msgid "The source HTML document or fragment."
msgstr "HTML 源文档或片段。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the bounds of the first laid-out element with the given case-sensitive HTML "
"[code]id[/code], in document coordinates. Pass the ID without [code]#[/code]. Returns an empty "
"rectangle if the element has no layout or the ID is absent."
msgstr "返回第一个具有指定 HTML [code]id[/code] 的已排版元素的边界，使用文档坐标。ID 区分大小写，传入时省略 [code]#[/code]。"
"元素尚未排版或 ID 不存在时返回空矩形。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Scrolls to a laid-out element by its case-sensitive HTML ID. Pass the ID without [code]#[/code]. "
"The vertical alignment ranges from [code]0.0[/code] at the top to [code]1.0[/code] at the bottom "
"and is clamped to the scrollable range. Returns [code]false[/code] if the ID is absent or the "
"layout is pending."
msgstr "按区分大小写的 HTML ID 滚动到已排版的元素，传入 ID 时省略 [code]#[/code]。垂直对齐从顶部的 [code]0.0[/code] "
"到底部的 [code]1.0[/code]，实际偏移限制在可滚动范围内。ID 不存在或布局尚未完成时返回 [code]false[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "A handle to an element in a parsed HTML layout."
msgstr "指向已解析 HTML 布局中某个元素的句柄。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a case-sensitive class name if it is absent. The name must be a single non-empty token "
"without ASCII whitespace."
msgstr "添加尚未存在的区分大小写的类名。类名必须是单个非空名称，且不能含有 ASCII 空白字符。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Adds or updates the named HTML attribute. The value is stored as literal text. An empty value "
"leaves the attribute present."
msgstr "添加或更新指定的 HTML 属性。属性值按原文保存，空值也会保留该属性。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted after a deferred layout update, when the new content size and scroll range can be "
"queried. Multiple element edits before the update are combined. The signal also reports a cleared"
" or failed layout and reflow caused by hover styles."
msgstr "延迟排版完成，且新内容尺寸和滚动范围可查询时发出。排版前的多次元素修改会合并。清空布局、排版失败或悬停样式触发重排时也会发出。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a left mouse press and release hit the same visible HTML element without dragging or"
" scrolling. Use [method HTMLElement.closest] to find an ancestor with an action attribute. For a "
"link, the built-in anchor scroll and [signal link_pressed] run first. The element signal is "
"emitted if the target still belongs to the current document."
msgstr ""
"鼠标左键在同一个可见 HTML 元素上按下并松开且期间未拖动或滚动时发出。可用 [method HTMLElement.closest] "
"查找带有动作属性的祖先元素。点击链接时，先执行内置锚点滚动并发出 [signal link_pressed]。目标仍属于当前文档时才发出元素点击信号。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Appends [param child] to the end of this element's children and preserves the subtree's handles. "
"Accepts both unattached elements from [method HTMLLayout.create_element] and existing elements from the same layout. "
"Cycles, moving the document root, and inserting elements into tags that cannot contain them are rejected."
msgstr "将 [param child] 追加到当前元素的子元素末尾，并保留子树的句柄。接受同一布局中通过 [method HTMLLayout.create_element] 创建的新元素或已有元素。形成循环、移动文档根元素或插入到不能容纳元素的标签时会返回错误。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Obtain a handle from [method HTMLLayout.query_selector] or [method HTMLLabel.query_selector]. A "
"handle belongs to one layout and stays valid across viewport resizes. While a handle is held, "
"querying or hitting the same element in that layout returns the same object. Parsing again, "
"clearing the layout, or freeing its owner invalidates it. An invalid handle returns empty results"
" or the supplied attribute default. Use these methods on the main thread.\n"
"Edits affect this layout only. Other views of the same [HTMLDocument] and the source resource are"
" unaffected. Queries and attribute reads see edits immediately. Geometry is available after the "
"next layout pass. [HTMLLabel] batches edits and emits [signal HTMLLabel.layout_changed] when the "
"new layout is ready. A standalone [HTMLLayout] with a previous viewport reflows on a deferred "
"call, or can be laid out immediately with [method HTMLLayout.layout].\n"
"Editing methods return [constant OK] on success and [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] for an "
"invalid handle or invalid arguments."
msgstr ""
"通过 [method HTMLLayout.query_selector] 或 [method HTMLLabel.query_selector] "
"获取句柄。句柄属于单个布局，调整视口尺寸后仍然有效。持有句柄期间，在同一布局中查询或命中同一个元素会返回同一对象。重新解析、清空布局或释放所属对象后，句柄会失效。无效句柄返回空结果或传入的属性默认值。请在主线程调用这些方法。"
"\n"
"修改只作用于当前布局。同一 [HTMLDocument] 的其他视图及源资源保持原状。查询和属性读取会立即反映修改，几何信息在下次排版后可用。[HTMLLabel] 会合并修改，新布局就绪后发出"
" [signal HTMLLabel.layout_changed]。已有视口的独立 [HTMLLayout] 会延迟重排，也可调用 [method HTMLLayout.layout] "
"立即重排。\n"
"编辑成功时返回 [constant OK]。句柄或参数无效时返回 [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Parses [param html] in the context of this element and replaces its children. The replaced "
"descendants' handles become invalid. Empty HTML clears the children. Use [method "
"set_text_content] to insert literal text."
msgstr "在当前元素的上下文中解析 [param html] 并替换子内容。被替换的后代元素句柄会失效。空 HTML 会清空子内容。用 [method set_text_content] 插入纯文本。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Removes the given class name if present. See [method add_class] for the name rules."
msgstr "移除已存在的指定类名。名称规则见 [method add_class]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Removes the named HTML attribute, if present. Attribute names are ASCII case-insensitive."
msgstr "移除已存在的指定 HTML 属性。属性名不区分 ASCII 大小写。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Removes this element and its subtree from their parent and invalidates their handles. Calling this method on an unattached element with no parent leaves it available for insertion. The document root cannot be removed."
msgstr "从父元素移除当前元素及其子树，并使其句柄失效。对尚未插入且没有父元素的元素调用此方法后，该元素仍可插入。文档根元素不能移除。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Creates an element owned by this layout after a successful [method parse]. Pass a tag name such as [code]li[/code] or [code]quest-card[/code]. ASCII letters in the name are lowercased. Returns [code]null[/code] if the name is invalid or there is no parsed document.\n"
"The new element has no parent. Set its attributes and content, then insert it using [method HTMLElement.append_child] on a parent from the same layout. Unattached elements are outside document queries and have no layout rectangles. On an empty document, the first creation also makes [code]html[/code], [code]head[/code], and [code]body[/code] available to queries."
msgstr ""
"[method parse] 成功后，创建归当前布局所有的元素。传入 [code]li[/code] 或 [code]quest-card[/code] 等标签名，名称中的 ASCII 字母会转换为小写。标签名无效或文档尚未解析时返回 [code]null[/code]。\n"
"新元素没有父元素。可以先设置属性和内容，再调用同一布局中父元素的 [method HTMLElement.append_child] 将其插入。未插入的元素不会出现在文档查询中，也没有布局矩形。在空文档中首次创建元素后，可以查询 [code]html[/code]、[code]head[/code] 和 [code]body[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Creates an unattached element in this label's layout. Parses any pending source first, so the new element and its parent can be prepared before the first layout update. Returns [code]null[/code] for an invalid name or a source that could not be parsed. See [method HTMLLayout.create_element].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var item: HTMLElement = label.create_element(\"li\")\n"
"var list: HTMLElement = label.query_selector(\"#quests\")\n"
"if item != null and list != null:\n"
"\titem.set_attribute(\"data-quest\", \"intro\")\n"
"\titem.set_text_content(\"Find the entrance\")\n"
"\tlist.append_child(item)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"在当前控件的布局中创建尚未插入的元素。若源文档等待解析，会先完成解析，因此可以在首次排版前准备新元素并查询其父元素。标签名无效或源文档解析失败时返回 [code]null[/code]。参见 [method HTMLLayout.create_element]。\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var item: HTMLElement = label.create_element(\"li\")\n"
"var list: HTMLElement = label.query_selector(\"#quests\")\n"
"if item != null and list != null:\n"
"\titem.set_attribute(\"data-quest\", \"intro\")\n"
"\titem.set_text_content(\"Find the entrance\")\n"
"\tlist.append_child(item)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces the children with literal text and invalidates the replaced descendants' handles. Empty "
"text clears the children."
msgstr "将子内容替换为纯文本，并使被替换的后代元素句柄失效。空文本会清空子内容。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a snapshot of the element's HTML attributes. Keys and values are strings. An explicitly "
"empty attribute has an empty string value."
msgstr "返回元素 HTML 属性的快照，键和值均为字符串。显式指定的空属性值为空字符串。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a snapshot of the element's [code]data-*[/code] attributes, using the same key conversion"
" as HTML dataset. For example, [code]data-item-id[/code] becomes [code]itemId[/code]."
msgstr ""
"返回元素 [code]data-*[/code] 属性的快照，键名沿用 HTML dataset 的转换规则。例如 [code]data-item-id[/code] 对应 "
"[code]itemId[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a snapshot of the matching descendants in document order, with each element included "
"once. [code]:scope[/code] refers to this element. Use [code]:scope > .title[/code] to select "
"direct children with the given class. See [method HTMLLayout.query_selector_all] for selector "
"syntax."
msgstr ""
"按文档顺序返回匹配的后代元素快照，每个元素只出现一次。[code]:scope[/code] 指当前元素。可用 [code]:scope > .title[/code] "
"选择带指定类名的直接子元素。选择器语法见 [method HTMLLayout.query_selector_all]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the class names in attribute order. Class names are case-sensitive and appear once in the"
" result."
msgstr "按属性中出现的顺序返回类名。类名区分大小写，重复的类名只出现一次。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the closest matching ancestor, starting with this element. [code]:scope[/code] refers to "
"this element. Returns [code]null[/code] if nothing matches."
msgstr "从当前元素开始向父级查找，返回最近的匹配项。[code]:scope[/code] 指当前元素。无匹配时返回 [code]null[/code]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the first matching descendant in document order, or [code]null[/code]. See [method "
"query_selector_all] for the query scope."
msgstr "按文档顺序返回第一个匹配的后代元素。无匹配时返回 [code]null[/code]。查询范围见 [method query_selector_all]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Returns whether the element has the given case-sensitive class name."
msgstr "返回元素是否包含指定的类名，区分大小写。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid "Returns whether this element matches the selector. [code]:scope[/code] refers to this element."
msgstr "返回当前元素是否匹配选择器。[code]:scope[/code] 指当前元素。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Serializes the current children as HTML, including text and comments. CSS-generated content is "
"excluded. Escaping and attribute order can differ from the original source."
msgstr "将当前子内容序列化为 HTML，包含文本和注释，跳过 CSS 生成的内容。转义形式和属性顺序可能与源文本不同。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Toggles the given class name when [param force] is [code]null[/code]. Pass [code]true[/code] to "
"add it or [code]false[/code] to remove it. Use [method has_class] to read the resulting state."
msgstr ""
"[param force] 为 [code]null[/code] 时切换指定类名。传入 [code]true[/code] 添加类名，传入 [code]false[/code] 移除类名。用 "
"[method has_class] 查询操作后的状态。"
